# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:101
msgid ""
"Fix the refinery machine.\n"
"\n"
"Hjarrand showed you where the machine is broken.  It's up to you to fix it."
msgstr ""
"修好精炼机。\n"
"\n"
"亚兰德已经指给你看机器坏在哪里。修理的事就要靠你了。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:104
msgid ""
"Fix the refinery machine.\n"
"\n"
"You have the broken Slag Extractor.  Try and get a replacement from Gunnar Thjorsmith in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"修好精炼机。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了损坏的矿渣提取器。设法向乔加德的贡纳尔·乔锻者要一个替换件。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:107
msgid ""
"Fix the refinery machine.\n"
"\n"
"You have a replacement Slag Extractor.  Return to the Thjorad Mine and install it."
msgstr ""
"修好精炼机。\n"
"\n"
"你有了替换用的矿渣提取器。回到乔拉德矿井把它装上。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:11
msgid ""
"Find Yrsa the Troll.\n"
"\n"
"Forad Darre suggested that if you find Yrsa the Troll, she may be able to help you leave the island."
msgstr ""
"找到巨魔伊尔莎。\n"
"\n"
"弗拉德·达尔建议，如果你能找到巨魔伊尔莎，她或许能帮你离开这座岛。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:110
msgid ""
"Find out why the Elemental Thjorad production has stopped.\n"
"\n"
"The East Mine, West Mine, and Refinery are now working.  Return to Thjorgard City and inform Jarl Sven."
msgstr ""
"查明元素乔拉德停产的原因。\n"
"\n"
"东矿、西矿和精炼厂都已恢复运转。回乔加德城向雅尔斯文复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:113
msgid ""
"Defeat Yanmir the Frost Giant.\n"
"\n"
"Go to Yanmir's Sky Fort in Frosgard and find a way to defeat the Frost Giant who lives there.  Return to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"击败霜巨人扬米尔。\n"
"\n"
"前往弗罗斯加德的扬米尔天空堡垒，想办法击败住在那里的霜巨人。完成后回到弗罗斯加德向雅尔特里格瓦复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:116
msgid ""
"Defeat Yanmir the Frost Giant.\n"
"\n"
"You've killed Yanmir the Frost Giant.  Now return to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"击败霜巨人扬米尔。\n"
"\n"
"你已杀死霜巨人扬米尔。现在回去见弗罗斯加德的雅尔特里格瓦。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:119
msgid ""
"Break up the ice that surrounds the docks.\n"
"\n"
"Find a way to break up the ice that surrounds the docks in Frosgard.  Return to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"破开围住码头的冰层。\n"
"\n"
"想办法破开弗罗斯加德码头周围的冰层。完成后回到弗罗斯加德向雅尔特里格瓦复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:122
msgid ""
"Break up the ice that surrounds the docks.\n"
"\n"
"Bodvar Elvissen has delivered a sunflower barrel to the edge of the docks.  Find it and destroy it to see if it will break up the ice."
msgstr ""
"破开围住码头的冰层。\n"
"\n"
"博德瓦尔·埃尔维斯森已把一只向日葵桶送到码头边缘。找到它并将其摧毁，看看能不能破开冰层。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:125
msgid ""
"Break up the ice that surrounds the docks.\n"
"\n"
"You've succeeded in breaking up the ice that surrounds the docks.  Return to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"破开围住码头的冰层。\n"
"\n"
"你成功破开了围住码头的冰层。回去见弗罗斯加德的雅尔特里格瓦。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:128
msgid ""
"Rid Thronheim of Honk worshippers.\n"
"\n"
"Find a way to rid Thronheim of Honk worshippers.  Just don't kill them.  Return to Kira the Cold in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"让索隆海姆摆脱嘎嘎信徒。\n"
"\n"
"想办法让索隆海姆摆脱嘎嘎信徒，但不许杀他们。完成后回到索隆海姆向冷血基拉复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:131
msgid ""
"Rid Thronheim of Honk worshippers.\n"
"\n"
"Moenach the dockmaster in Thronheim has agreed to shanhai the Honkies.  Find all three Honkies and try to convince them to visit the docks."
msgstr ""
"让索隆海姆摆脱嘎嘎信徒。\n"
"\n"
"索隆海姆的码头主管莫埃纳克同意把这些嘎嘎信徒绑上船。找到全部三名信徒，设法说服他们去码头。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:134
msgid ""
"Rid Thronheim of Honk worshippers.\n"
"\n"
"All the Honkies are on their way to the docks.  Return to Kira the Cold in Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"让索隆海姆摆脱嘎嘎信徒。\n"
"\n"
"所有嘎嘎信徒都已前往码头。回到索隆海姆去见冷血基拉。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:137
msgid ""
"Find the Mountain Pass.\n"
"\n"
"Find and clear the Mountain Pass between Thronheim and Thjorgard.  Return to Kira the Cold in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"找到山口。\n"
"\n"
"找到并清理索隆海姆与乔加德之间的山口。完成后回到索隆海姆向冷血基拉复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:14
msgid ""
"Find a way off the island.\n"
"\n"
"You have a task to perform.  The first step is to find a way off this island.  Yrsa suggested you speak to Forad Darre."
msgstr ""
"找到离岛的办法。\n"
"\n"
"你身负使命，第一步是找到离开这座岛的办法。伊尔莎建议你去找弗拉德·达尔谈谈。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:140
msgid ""
"Find the Mountain Pass.\n"
"\n"
"You've traveled through the Mountain Pass.  Return to Kira the Cold with its location."
msgstr ""
"找到山口。\n"
"\n"
"你已穿过山口。带着它的位置回去见冷血基拉。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:143
msgid ""
"Go to Thronheim for the war council.\n"
"\n"
"Now that the clans are united, there is to be a war council in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr ""
"前往索隆海姆参加战争会议。\n"
"\n"
"如今各氏族已经团结起来，两周后将在索隆海姆召开战争会议。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:146
msgid ""
"Stop the war between Sturmford and Drangheim.\n"
"\n"
"Find out why Sturmford and Drangheim have gone to war with each other, and stop them from fighting.  Return to the War Council in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"制止斯图姆福德与德朗海姆之间的战争。\n"
"\n"
"查明斯图姆福德与德朗海姆为何开战，并阻止他们厮杀。完成后回到索隆海姆的战争会议。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:149
msgid ""
"Stop the war between Sturmford and Drangheim.\n"
"\n"
"Bjarni and Sigmund have agreed to sign the peace treaty.  Meet them at Kira's Palace in Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"制止斯图姆福德与德朗海姆之间的战争。\n"
"\n"
"比亚尔尼和西格蒙德已同意签署和平条约。到索隆海姆的基拉宫与他们会面。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:152
msgid ""
"Stop the war between Sturmford and Drangheim.\n"
"\n"
"Bjarni said he's willing to sign a peace treaty.  Find someone to write it."
msgstr ""
"制止斯图姆福德与德朗海姆之间的战争。\n"
"\n"
"比亚尔尼表示愿意签署和平条约。找个人来起草条约。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:155
msgid ""
"Stop the war between Sturmford and Drangheim.\n"
"\n"
"Sigmund is willing to sign a peace treaty.  Find someone to write it."
msgstr ""
"制止斯图姆福德与德朗海姆之间的战争。\n"
"\n"
"西格蒙德愿意签署和平条约。找个人来起草条约。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:158
msgid ""
"Stop the war between Sturmford and Drangheim.\n"
"\n"
"Kira has written a peace treaty for Sturmford and Drangheim.  Get Sigmund and Bjarni to agree to sign it."
msgstr ""
"制止斯图姆福德与德朗海姆之间的战争。\n"
"\n"
"基拉已为斯图姆福德和德朗海姆写好了和平条约。让西格蒙德和比亚尔尼同意签字。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:161
msgid ""
"Win a prize at the Thing for Yrsa's daughter.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Thing in Thjorgard, and get the prize for Yrsa's daughter Bikki by winning all the games.  Once you have the prize, take it to Bikki Yrsadotir in Thronheim.  Return to the War Council in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"在民会上为伊尔莎的女儿赢得奖品。\n"
"\n"
"前往乔加德的民会，赢下所有比赛，为伊尔莎的女儿比基赢得奖品。拿到奖品后，把它送给索隆海姆的比基·伊尔莎多蒂尔。完成后回到索隆海姆的战争会议。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:164
msgid ""
"Win a prize at the Thing for Yrsa's daughter.\n"
"\n"
"You have the Prize.  Take it to Yrsa's daughter Bikki."
msgstr ""
"在民会上为伊尔莎的女儿赢得奖品。\n"
"\n"
"你已拿到奖品。把它送给伊尔莎的女儿比基。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:167
msgid ""
"Return to War Council.\n"
"\n"
"You've delivered Bikki's prize.  Return to the War Council in Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"回到战争会议。\n"
"\n"
"你已送出比基的奖品。回到索隆海姆的战争会议。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:17
msgid ""
"Help Yrsa the Troll.\n"
"\n"
"There are a group of dragonflies beyond the tunnel near Yrsa's hut.  Find them and kill them all."
msgstr ""
"帮助巨魔伊尔莎。\n"
"\n"
"伊尔莎小屋附近的隧道另一头有一群龙蝇。找到它们，全部杀死。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:170
msgid ""
"Meet army in Yorwick.\n"
"\n"
"Travel through the Connecting Tunnels to Yorwick and join the coalition army."
msgstr ""
"到约维克与军队会合。\n"
"\n"
"穿过连通隧道前往约维克，加入联军。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:173
msgid ""
"Get your army back.\n"
"\n"
"Find a way to travel to Arslegard and speak to Skraelos to get your soldiers back."
msgstr ""
"夺回你的军队。\n"
"\n"
"想办法前往阿斯勒加德，找斯克雷洛斯要回你的士兵。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:176
msgid ""
"Get a Writ of Fate.\n"
"\n"
"Get a Writ of Fate from the Wyrdes so Hanndl will let you into Arslegard."
msgstr ""
"取得命运令状。\n"
"\n"
"向维尔德众求取一份命运令状，好让汉恩德尔放你进入阿斯勒加德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:179
msgid ""
"Take the Capstone of Order to the Verhoffin Ruins\n"
"\n"
"Get the Capstone of Order from Guberland and take it to the Verhoffin Ruins."
msgstr ""
"把秩序之冠石送到维尔霍芬废墟\n"
"\n"
"从古伯兰取得秩序之冠石，并把它送到维尔霍芬废墟。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:182
msgid ""
"Take the Capstone of Order to the Verhoffin Ruins\n"
"\n"
"Thorir Mouth of Guberland will trade the Capstone of Order for a wooden sword, a wooden shield, a fur cap, a pair of cloth gloves, a set of quilted armor, and a pair of fuzzy slippers."
msgstr ""
"把秩序之冠石送到维尔霍芬废墟\n"
"\n"
"古伯兰的托里尔·大嘴愿意用秩序之冠石交换：一把木剑、一面木盾、一顶毛皮帽、一副布手套、一套绗缝甲，以及一双毛绒拖鞋。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:185
msgid ""
"Take the Capstone of Order to the Verhoffin Ruins\n"
"\n"
"You have the Capstone of Order.  Take it to the Verhoffin Ruins and place it on the pedestal in the Lab Room."
msgstr ""
"把秩序之冠石送到维尔霍芬废墟\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了秩序之冠石。把它送到维尔霍芬废墟，放在实验室里的基座上。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:188
msgid ""
"Pick up the Writ of Fate.\n"
"\n"
"You have placed the Capstone of Order in the Verhoffin Ruins.  Pick up the Writ of Fate from the altar in the Lab Room, then show it to Hanndl at the Great Gate in Arslegard to get in."
msgstr ""
"取走命运令状。\n"
"\n"
"你已把秩序之冠石放进维尔霍芬废墟。从实验室的祭坛上取走命运令状，再拿给阿斯勒加德大门前的汉恩德尔看，就能进城。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:191
msgid ""
"Return to Arslegard.\n"
"\n"
"You've got a Writ of Fate.  Show it to Hanndl at the Great Gate in Arslegard to get in."
msgstr ""
"回到阿斯勒加德。\n"
"\n"
"你已拿到命运令状。把它拿给阿斯勒加德大门前的汉恩德尔看，就能进城。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:194
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Go to The Afterworld in Arslegard and light the Six Fires of Penance.  Return to Skraelos in the Hall of the Gods when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"前往阿斯勒加德的来世，点燃六重赎罪之火。完成后回到众神殿向斯克雷洛斯复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:197
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Confession:  Find the Six Jarls and confess to them your guilt."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"忏悔：找到六位雅尔，向他们坦白你的罪愆。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:2
msgid ""
"Complete your training.\n"
"\n"
"The Old Man believes you are finally ready to leave Ravensford.  Read the scroll he's given you to begin your training.  If you don't think you need any training, sell your scroll back to a shopkeeper and head north."
msgstr ""
"完成你的训练。\n"
"\n"
"老人认为你终于可以离开渡鸦渡口了。读一读他交给你的卷轴，开始训练。如果你觉得自己不需要训练，就把卷轴卖回给店主，然后北上。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:20
msgid ""
"Kill the Bone Thrashers.\n"
"\n"
"To be able to leave the island, you have to stop the bone thrashers from coming over from their mausoleum.  Forad suggested there might be something behind the locked door that could help."
msgstr ""
"杀死碎骨者。\n"
"\n"
"要离开这座岛，你必须阻止碎骨者从它们的陵墓里涌出来。弗拉德说，上锁的门后或许有能帮上忙的东西。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:200
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Suffering:  You must suffer until you satisfy the Questioner."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"受难：你必须不断受苦，直到审问官满意为止。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:203
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Retribution:  Find and kill the ghostly versions of the Beldonian Horde."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"报应：找出并杀死贝尔多尼亚部落军的幽灵。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:206
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Absolution:  Find all five of the Jarls' swords and return them to Skraelos."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"宽恕：找齐五位雅尔的全部佩剑，交还给斯克雷洛斯。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:209
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"Rebirth.  You've lit five of the six fires.  Find the blazing inferno out there and step through it to be reborn."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"重生：你已点燃六火中的五道。找到远处那团熊熊烈焰，踏入其中获得重生。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:212
msgid ""
"Light the Six Fires of Penance.\n"
"\n"
"You've lit the Six Fires.  Return to Skraelos and ask him to give you your soldiers back."
msgstr ""
"点燃六重赎罪之火。\n"
"\n"
"你已点燃六重赎罪之火。回去找斯克雷洛斯，请他把士兵还给你。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:215
msgid ""
"Speak to Sven Forkbeard.\n"
"\n"
"Find Sven Forkbeard in Arslegard and speak to him about leading the army against the Beldonian Hordes."
msgstr ""
"与叉须斯文交谈。\n"
"\n"
"在阿斯勒加德找到叉须斯文，和他谈谈率军对抗贝尔多尼亚部落军的事。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:218
msgid ""
"Lead Army against the Beldonian Hordes.\n"
"\n"
"The Beldonian Horde is moving toward Frosgard.  Travel there and stop Tamur Leng and Forad Darre once and for all!"
msgstr ""
"率军对抗贝尔多尼亚部落军。\n"
"\n"
"贝尔多尼亚部落军正向弗罗斯加德进发。赶往那里，彻底击败塔穆尔·伦格和弗拉德·达尔！"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:221
msgid ""
"Find out why you and Tamur Leng have Writs of Fate.\n"
"\n"
"Find out why you and Tamur Leng have conflicting Writs of Fate."
msgstr ""
"查明你与塔穆尔·伦格为何都持有命运令状。\n"
"\n"
"查明为什么你与塔穆尔·伦格持有互相冲突的命运令状。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:224
msgid ""
"Stand before Krohn.\n"
"\n"
"You and Tamur Leng have been summoned to the Hall of the Gods in Arslegard to stand before Krohn."
msgstr ""
"面见克罗恩。\n"
"\n"
"你与塔穆尔·伦格被召至阿斯勒加德的众神殿，站到克罗恩面前。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:227
msgid ""
"Imprison Njam the Meddler in the Tomb of 1000 Terrors.\n"
"\n"
"Find a way to lure Njam into the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors.  Once there, find a way to imprison Njam the Meddler."
msgstr ""
"把多管闲事的尼亚姆囚禁在千惧之墓。\n"
"\n"
"想办法把尼亚姆引入千惧之墓。到了那里，再设法将多管闲事的尼亚姆囚禁起来。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:23
msgid ""
"Unite the Clans.\n"
"\n"
"Yrsa has commanded you to unite the six clans of the Chedian against the Beldonian Hordes.  Perhaps you should speak to the six clan leaders."
msgstr ""
"团结各氏族。\n"
"\n"
"伊尔莎命令你团结切迪安的六大氏族，共同对抗贝尔多尼亚部落军。或许你该去找六位氏族首领谈谈。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:230
msgid ""
"Speak to Atli Sigmundssen.\n"
"\n"
"Find Atli Sigmundssen in Guberland and find out how you can help him move to Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"与阿特利·西格蒙德森交谈。\n"
"\n"
"在古伯兰找到阿特利·西格蒙德森，问问怎样才能帮他搬到索隆海姆。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:233
msgid ""
"Guard Atli Sigmundssen's Boat.\n"
"\n"
"Relieve Atli's guard at 3:00am and guard the boat until Atli relieves you at 6:00am."
msgstr ""
"守卫阿特利·西格蒙德森的船。\n"
"\n"
"凌晨3点接替阿特利的岗，守着船，直到凌晨6点阿特利来换你。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:236
msgid ""
"Speak to Atli Sigmundssen.\n"
"\n"
"Now that he has relieved you, speak to Atli to make sure he doesn't need anymore of your help."
msgstr ""
"与阿特利·西格蒙德森交谈。\n"
"\n"
"他已经来换岗了，找阿特利谈谈，确认他不再需要你帮忙。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:239
msgid ""
"Defeat the Yobboes.\n"
"\n"
"Find the Yobboe Gang in Drangheim, defeat them, and return the villagers' things to them."
msgstr ""
"击败尤博帮。\n"
"\n"
"到德朗海姆找到尤博帮，击败他们，并把村民的东西还给他们。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:242
msgid ""
"Return the Plow.\n"
"\n"
"You've got his plow, now return it to Hring Plowhands in Drangheim Village."
msgstr ""
"归还犁。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了他的犁，现在把它还给德朗海姆村的赫林·犁手。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:245
msgid ""
"Return the Dolly.\n"
"\n"
"You've got her dolly, now return it to Tyock A'Norta a'leipshi in Drangheim Village"
msgstr ""
"归还玩偶。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了她的玩偶，现在把它还给德朗海姆村的提约克·阿诺尔塔·阿雷普希。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:248
msgid ""
"Return the Herbs.\n"
"\n"
"You've got her herbs, now return them to Ragnheid Lifegiver in Drangheim Village"
msgstr ""
"归还草药。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了她的草药，现在把它们还给德朗海姆村的拉格奈德·赐命者。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:251
msgid ""
"Defeat the Yobboes.\n"
"\n"
"You've defeated the Yobboes.  Return to Keith Bloodaxe in Drangheim City for your reward."
msgstr ""
"击败尤博帮。\n"
"\n"
"你已击败尤博帮。回德朗海姆城向基思·血斧领取奖励。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:254
msgid ""
"Study a Magreeb.\n"
"\n"
"Find a Magreeb in Thjorgard and study it.  Return to the Bembridge University when you are finished to report your findings."
msgstr ""
"研究马格里卜。\n"
"\n"
"在乔加德找到一只马格里卜并加以研究。完成后回到本布里奇大学汇报你的发现。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:257
msgid ""
"Study a Magreeb.\n"
"\n"
"You've found a Magreeb and studied it.  Return to Tymon the Nord at the Bembridge University in Thjorgard to report your findings."
msgstr ""
"研究马格里卜。\n"
"\n"
"你已找到并研究了马格里卜。回到乔加德本布里奇大学，向诺德人提蒙汇报你的发现。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:26
msgid ""
"Slay the Dragon.\n"
"\n"
"The first step in slaying a dragon is proving your worth.  Speak to Snorri the Fist in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"屠龙。\n"
"\n"
"屠龙的第一步是证明你的价值。去乔加德找拳头斯诺里谈谈。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:260
msgid ""
"Heal Nutty Nurtigan.\n"
"\n"
"Find a way to heal Nutty Nurtigan in Guberland.  Return to Tjolnir the Super-neat in Guberland when you've succeeded."
msgstr ""
"治好疯癫的努尔蒂根。\n"
"\n"
"想办法治好古伯兰的疯癫努尔蒂根。成功后回到古伯兰找超级整洁的约尔尼尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:263
msgid ""
"Heal Nutty Nurtigan.\n"
"\n"
"Skarphedinn Njalssen at the apothecary in Guberland said he needed a lock of the Old Hag's hair to make the potion to cure Nurtigan."
msgstr ""
"治好疯癫的努尔蒂根。\n"
"\n"
"古伯兰药铺的斯卡尔菲丁·尼亚尔森说，要配制治疗努尔蒂根的药剂，需要一绺老妖婆的头发。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:266
msgid ""
"Heal Nutty Nurtigan.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the lock of hair.  Take it to Skarphedinn Njalssen at the apothecary in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"治好疯癫的努尔蒂根。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了那绺头发。把它送到古伯兰药铺的斯卡尔菲丁·尼亚尔森那里。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:269
msgid ""
"Heal Nutty Nurtigan.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the potion to heal Nurtigan.  Take it to his cage next to Markel's Palace and give it to him."
msgstr ""
"治好疯癫的努尔蒂根。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了治疗努尔蒂根的药剂。把它送到马克尔宫旁边他的笼子那里，让他服下。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:272
msgid ""
"Heal Nutty Nurtigan.\n"
"\n"
"You've healed Nurtigan.  Return to Tjolnir the Super-neat in Guberland to get your promotion."
msgstr ""
"治好疯癫的努尔蒂根。\n"
"\n"
"你治好了努尔蒂根。回到古伯兰找超级整洁的约尔尼尔领取晋升。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:275
msgid ""
"Kill a basilisk.\n"
"\n"
"Find and kill a basilisk.  Bring its skin back to Fridleif Gjukissen of Sturmford when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"杀死一只石化蜥蜴。\n"
"\n"
"找到并杀死一只石化蜥蜴。完成后把它的皮带给斯图姆福德的弗里德莱夫·约基森。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:278
msgid ""
"Get Kira's shield.\n"
"\n"
"Go to Thronheim and retrieve the shield of Kira the Cold.  Return to Fridleif Gjukissen of Sturmford when you have the shield."
msgstr ""
"取回基拉的盾牌。\n"
"\n"
"前往索隆海姆，取回冷血基拉的盾牌。拿到盾牌后回去找斯图姆福德的弗里德莱夫·约基森。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:281
msgid ""
"Get Kira's shield.\n"
"\n"
"You've got Kira's Shield.  Return it to Fridleif Gjukissen of Sturmford."
msgstr ""
"取回基拉的盾牌。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了基拉的盾牌。把它交还给斯图姆福德的弗里德莱夫·约基森。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:284
msgid ""
"Win in the Arena.\n"
"\n"
"Win in the Arena at Lord level.  Return to Fridleif Gjukissen of Sturmford when you have succeeded."
msgstr ""
"在竞技场获胜。\n"
"\n"
"在竞技场以领主级别获胜。成功后回去找斯图姆福德的弗里德莱夫·约基森。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:287
msgid ""
"Win in the Arena.\n"
"\n"
"You've won in the Arena at Lord level.  Return to Fridleif Gjukissen of Guberland."
msgstr ""
"在竞技场获胜。\n"
"\n"
"你已在竞技场以领主级别获胜。回去找古伯兰的弗里德莱夫·约基森。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:29
msgid ""
"Slay the Dragon.\n"
"\n"
"The old man put you on the path.  Complete his task to prove your worth."
msgstr ""
"屠龙。\n"
"\n"
"老人已为你指明道路。完成他的任务，证明你的价值。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:290
msgid ""
"Steal the knife.\n"
"\n"
"Go to Lord Kluso's house in Drangheim and steal his treasured knife.  Return to Atli the Quick when you have the artifact."
msgstr ""
"偷走那把刀。\n"
"\n"
"前往德朗海姆的克卢索领主府邸，偷走他珍爱的刀。拿到这件宝物后回去找迅捷的阿特利。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:293
msgid ""
"Steal knife.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the knife.  Return to Atli the Quick."
msgstr ""
"偷走那把刀。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了刀。回去找迅捷的阿特利。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:296
msgid ""
"Kill Guaire A'Velsi.\n"
"\n"
"Find Guaire A'Velsi in Drangheim and kill him.  Return to Atli the Quick when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"杀死盖尔·阿维尔西。\n"
"\n"
"在德朗海姆找到盖尔·阿维尔西并杀死他。完成后回去找迅捷的阿特利。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:299
msgid ""
"Kill Guaire A'Velsi.\n"
"\n"
"You've killed Guaire A'Velsi.  Return to Atli the Quick."
msgstr ""
"杀死盖尔·阿维尔西。\n"
"\n"
"你已杀死盖尔·阿维尔西。回去找迅捷的阿特利。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:302
msgid ""
"Stop Jarl Sven's assassination.\n"
"\n"
"Stop Jarl Sven Forkbeard of Thjorgard from being assassinated. Show the letter to Jarl Sven in Thjorgard.  Return to Grehgknak the Right in Lindisfarne when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"阻止雅尔斯文遇刺。\n"
"\n"
"阻止乔加德的雅尔叉须斯文遇刺。把信交给乔加德的雅尔斯文。完成后回到林迪斯法恩找正直的格雷格纳克。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:305
msgid ""
"Stop Jarl Sven's assassination.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Arena and stop Sven's double from being assassinated."
msgstr ""
"阻止雅尔斯文遇刺。\n"
"\n"
"前往竞技场，阻止斯文的替身遇刺。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:308
msgid ""
"Find Harris Willington.\n"
"\n"
"Find Harris Willington.  Report back to Jarl Sven of Thjorgard.  When you are finished return to Grehgknak the Right in Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""
"找到哈里斯·威灵顿。\n"
"\n"
"找到哈里斯·威灵顿，然后向乔加德的雅尔斯文汇报。完成后回到林迪斯法恩找正直的格雷格纳克。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:311
msgid ""
"Arrest the thief.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the town hall clerks and find who is having trouble with theives.  When you have found the thief, arrest him, and take him to the town jail."
msgstr ""
"逮捕窃贼。\n"
"\n"
"去镇公所找文书们，问出谁被窃贼骚扰。找到窃贼后将其逮捕，押往镇上的监牢。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:314
msgid ""
"Arrest the thief.\n"
"\n"
"You've arrested Hatlati Oord for stealing.  Take him to the jail inside the Sturmford Town Hall."
msgstr ""
"逮捕窃贼。\n"
"\n"
"你因盗窃逮捕了哈特拉蒂·奥德。把他押到斯图姆福德镇公所内的监牢。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:317
msgid ""
"Help the Oor'ds help themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Speak to Hatlati's family.  Find a way for them to provide for themselves."
msgstr ""
"帮助奥德一家自食其力。\n"
"\n"
"与哈特拉蒂的家人谈谈，想办法让他们能养活自己。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:32
msgid ""
"Slay the Dragon.\n"
"\n"
"Snorri the Fist has instructed you to meet Abbot Leffery Caid in Lindisfarne.  He will show you how to summon the dragon."
msgstr ""
"屠龙。\n"
"\n"
"拳头斯诺里让你去林迪斯法恩会见莱弗里·凯德院长。他会告诉你如何召唤巨龙。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:320
msgid ""
"Find Itlor a job.\n"
"\n"
"Itlor wants a job so he can provide for his family.  There must be someone around Sturmford who is willing to give him a job.  Return to Grehgknak the right when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"为伊特洛找份工作。\n"
"\n"
"伊特洛想找份工作养家。斯图姆福德一带一定有人愿意雇他。完成后回去找正直的格雷格纳克。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:323
msgid ""
"Find Everstrike.\n"
"\n"
"Find the bow known as Everstrike.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend when you have it."
msgstr ""
"寻找永击。\n"
"\n"
"找到名为永击的弓。拿到后回去找芬雅·树友。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:326
msgid ""
"Pass through Dungeon of Secrets.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Dungeon of Secrets in Frosgard.  Pass through the dungeon without setting off a single trap.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"通过秘密地牢。\n"
"\n"
"前往弗罗斯加德的秘密地牢，在不触发任何一个陷阱的情况下通过地牢。完成后回去找芬雅·树友。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:329
msgid ""
"Pass through Dungeon of Secrets.\n"
"\n"
"You've completed the Dungeon of Secrets.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend."
msgstr ""
"通过秘密地牢。\n"
"\n"
"你已通过秘密地牢。回去找芬雅·树友。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:332
msgid ""
"Find a new priest for the new temple.\n"
"\n"
"Find a priest who would be willing to take over the new temple to Igdrasa you are building.  Return to Gray Slemnir when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"为新神殿找一位新祭司。\n"
"\n"
"找一位愿意接管你们正在修建的伊格德拉莎新神殿的祭司。完成后回去找格雷·斯莱姆尼尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:335
msgid ""
"Find a new Tree of Life.\n"
"\n"
"Find the Ruined Temple in Frosgard and recover the Tree of Life symbol.  Take it to Gray Slemnir in Guberland when you have acquired it."
msgstr ""
"寻找新的生命之树。\n"
"\n"
"找到弗罗斯加德的废弃神殿，取回生命之树的象征物。拿到后送到古伯兰的格雷·斯莱姆尼尔那里。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:338
msgid ""
"Learn the Ritual of Consecration.\n"
"\n"
"Find Nath'i A'Mor in Frosgard and convince him to teach you the Ritual of Consecration.  Return to Gray Slemnir when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"学习祝圣仪式。\n"
"\n"
"在弗罗斯加德找到纳希·阿莫尔，说服他教你祝圣仪式。完成后回去找格雷·斯莱姆尼尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:341
msgid ""
"Find the Green Man.\n"
"\n"
"Find the Green Man in Frosgard, and ask him what you can do to help him return to Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"找到绿人。\n"
"\n"
"在弗罗斯加德找到绿人，问问你能做些什么，帮他回到弗罗斯加德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:344
msgid ""
"Get a promise from Frosgard.\n"
"\n"
"Get a promise from at least seven residents of Frosgard that they will not neglect the Green Man.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"取得弗罗斯加德的承诺。\n"
"\n"
"让至少七名弗罗斯加德居民承诺不会怠慢绿人。完成后回去找绿人。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:347
msgid ""
"Get a promise from Frosgard.\n"
"\n"
"The citizens of Frosgard have promised not to neglect the Green Man.  Return to him when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"取得弗罗斯加德的承诺。\n"
"\n"
"弗罗斯加德的居民已承诺不会怠慢绿人。等你完成他的其他任务后，再回去见他。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:35
msgid ""
"Slay the Dragon.\n"
"\n"
"Leffery Caid has the relic.  Perhaps now you will meet the dragon in his cave in Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""
"屠龙。\n"
"\n"
"莱弗里·凯德已经拿到圣物。也许现在你可以去林迪斯法恩的洞穴里会一会那条龙了。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:350
msgid ""
"Fix the maypole in the center of town.\n"
"\n"
"Find someone in Frosgard who will repair the old maypole.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"修好镇中心的五月柱。\n"
"\n"
"在弗罗斯加德找人修理那根古老的五月柱。完成后回去找绿人。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:353
msgid ""
"Fix the maypole in the center of town.\n"
"\n"
"Soxolf will fix the maypole at the center of town.  Return to the Green Man when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"修好镇中心的五月柱。\n"
"\n"
"索克索尔夫会修好镇中心的五月柱。等你完成绿人的其他任务后，再回去见他。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:356
msgid ""
"Get Tryygva to erect a runestone.\n"
"\n"
"Speak to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard.  Convince him to commit a promise to celebrate the Green Man to stone and place that stone next to the maypole.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"让特里格瓦竖起一块符文石。\n"
"\n"
"去找弗罗斯加德的雅尔特里格瓦，说服他把庆祝绿人的承诺刻在石头上，并将这块石头立在五月柱旁。完成后回去找绿人。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:359
msgid ""
"Get Tryygva to erect a runestone.\n"
"\n"
"Tryygva agreed to erect a runestone.  Return to the Green Man when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"让特里格瓦竖起一块符文石。\n"
"\n"
"特里格瓦同意竖起符文石。等你完成绿人的其他任务后，再回去见他。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:362
msgid ""
"Find Verhoffin's Diary.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Verhoffin Ruins on the Isle of Ashes and recover Verhoffin's Diary.  Return to Johannes Bem in Thjorgard when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"寻找维尔霍芬的日记。\n"
"\n"
"前往灰烬岛上的维尔霍芬废墟，取回维尔霍芬的日记。完成后回到乔加德找约翰内斯·贝姆。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:365
msgid ""
"Become a Lich.\n"
"\n"
"Follow the Lich Instructions and become a lich."
msgstr ""
"成为巫妖。\n"
"\n"
"按照巫妖指引成为一名巫妖。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:368
msgid ""
"Survive the Training Hall.\n"
"\n"
"Find the Training Hall in Thjorgard and survive its trials."
msgstr ""
"在训练大厅中幸存。\n"
"\n"
"在乔加德找到训练大厅，并熬过其中的试炼。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:371
msgid ""
"Find the saboteur.\n"
"\n"
"Find out who is sabotaging Sturmford's defenses.  Report back to Bjarni Herjolfssen when you have uncovered who it is."
msgstr ""
"找出破坏者。\n"
"\n"
"查明是谁在破坏斯图姆福德的防御。查出此人后向比亚尔尼·赫约尔夫森汇报。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:374
msgid ""
"Take love letter to Kira the Cold.\n"
"\n"
"Jarl Bjarni has given you a love letter he wrote to Kira the Cold.  Take it to her in Thronheim, and report back to Bjarni when you have her response."
msgstr ""
"把情书送给冷血基拉。\n"
"\n"
"雅尔比亚尔尼交给你一封他写给冷血基拉的情书。把信送到索隆海姆交给她，拿到她的回复后向比亚尔尼汇报。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:377
msgid ""
"Retrieve Ludwig's Manuscript.\n"
"\n"
"Ludwig Van dropped his manuscript down the cellar of his Beet Hoven.  Go down into the sewers below his Beet Hoven and bring his manuscript back for him."
msgstr ""
"取回路德维希的手稿。\n"
"\n"
"路德维希·范把手稿掉进了他的甜菜贝多芬地窖。下到甜菜贝多芬下方的下水道，把手稿找回来。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:38
msgid ""
"Clear out Anskram Keep.\n"
"\n"
"Bjarni Thorvaldssen, the Jarl of Sturmford has asked you to rid Anskram Keep in Sturmford of the imps that have inhabited it.  Destroy the portals they are coming from.  Return to him when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"肃清安斯克拉姆要塞。\n"
"\n"
"斯图姆福德的雅尔比亚尔尼·托瓦尔德森请你清除盘踞在斯图姆福德安斯克拉姆要塞里的小恶魔。摧毁它们涌出的传送门。完成后回去见他。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:380
msgid ""
"Convince the Dook to leave Guberland.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Dook's Castle in Guberland and convince the Dook to leave.  Return to Jarl Markel of Guberland when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"说服公爵离开古伯兰。\n"
"\n"
"前往古伯兰的公爵城堡，说服公爵离开。完成后回到古伯兰向雅尔马克尔复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:383
msgid ""
"Convince the Dook to leave Guberland.\n"
"\n"
"You've convinced the Dook to leave.  Return to Jarl Markel of Guberland."
msgstr ""
"说服公爵离开古伯兰。\n"
"\n"
"你已说服公爵离开。回去见古伯兰的雅尔马克尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:386
msgid ""
"Get Nicolai a job.\n"
"\n"
"Nicolai Ironfist of Drangheim is down on his luck.  Try to find him a job.  There's got to be a circus around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"为尼古拉找份工作。\n"
"\n"
"德朗海姆的尼古拉·铁拳时运不济。设法给他找份工作。这附近总该有个马戏团吧。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:389
msgid ""
"Get Nicolai a job.\n"
"\n"
"Thorir Mouth of Guberland offered Nicolai a job.  Return to Nicolai in Drangheim to tell him."
msgstr ""
"为尼古拉找份工作。\n"
"\n"
"古伯兰的托里尔·大嘴愿意给尼古拉一份工作。回德朗海姆把这个消息告诉尼古拉。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:392
msgid ""
"Get Nicolai a job.\n"
"\n"
"Nicolai has accepted the job.  Return to Thorir Mouth in Guberland for your reward."
msgstr ""
"为尼古拉找份工作。\n"
"\n"
"尼古拉接受了这份工作。回古伯兰找托里尔·大嘴领取奖励。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:395
msgid ""
"Find out who is spreading gossip.\n"
"\n"
"Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim is worried about the gossip spreading throughout his clan.  Find out who's tongue is wagging.  Return to Jarl Sigmund in Drangheim when you have discovered who is responsible."
msgstr ""
"查明是谁在散布流言。\n"
"\n"
"德朗海姆的雅尔西格蒙德担心流言在氏族中蔓延。查出是谁嚼的舌根。查出元凶后回德朗海姆向雅尔西格蒙德汇报。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:398
msgid ""
"Find out who is spreading gossip.\n"
"\n"
"Greudach A'Dorad has fingered Marsaili A'Lanth in Sturmford.  Go find them and tell them to stop spreading the rumors."
msgstr ""
"查明是谁在散布流言。\n"
"\n"
"格鲁达克·阿多拉德指认斯图姆福德的马赛利·阿兰斯是散布者。去找到她，叫她别再传谣言。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:401
msgid ""
"Find out who is spreading gossip.\n"
"\n"
"Marsaili A'Lanth refused to stop spreading lies.  Return to Sigmund with the information."
msgstr ""
"查明是谁在散布流言。\n"
"\n"
"马赛利·阿兰斯拒绝停止散布谎言。带着这个消息回去见西格蒙德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:404
msgid ""
"Sell Brewmaster Smith's new concoction to Guberland.\n"
"\n"
"Take the cask Brewmaster Smith gave you to the tavern in Guberland, and try to get the bartender to purchase it from you.  Once you have succeeded, return to Brewmaster Smith"
msgstr ""
"向古伯兰推销酿酒师史密斯的新酿。\n"
"\n"
"把酿酒师史密斯给你的酒桶带到古伯兰的酒馆，设法让酒保从你手里买下。成功后回去找酿酒师史密斯。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:407
msgid ""
"Get Black Orb of Knowledge.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Wizard's Lab in Yorwick, and get the Black Orb of Knowledge from the Mad Wizard Robinsson.  Return to Ealusaid A'Norta a'thrakan in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"取得知识黑宝珠。\n"
"\n"
"前往约维克的巫师实验室，从疯狂巫师罗宾逊手中取得知识黑宝珠。完成后回到索隆海姆找艾卢赛德·阿诺尔塔·阿塔克兰。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:41
msgid ""
"Clear out Anskram Keep.\n"
"\n"
"You have destroyed the imp portals.  Return to Jarl Bjarni in Sturmford City."
msgstr ""
"肃清安斯克拉姆要塞。\n"
"\n"
"你已摧毁小恶魔的传送门。回斯图姆福德城去见雅尔比亚尔尼。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:410
msgid ""
"Take the news to the Temple of Ratatosk.\n"
"\n"
"Take the Scroll of Bad News to Erlend the Nay-sayer in the Temple of Ratatosk.  Return to Dagfari the Peevish in Thronheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"把消息带到拉塔托斯克神殿。\n"
"\n"
"把坏消息卷轴送给拉塔托斯克神殿的爱说不的埃尔伦德。完成后回到索隆海姆找易怒的达格法里。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:413
msgid ""
"Get the Orbs of Linking.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Inventa Storca in Thronheim and collect six Orbs of Linking.  Install them in the six banks in Chedian."
msgstr ""
"取得连接宝珠。\n"
"\n"
"前往索隆海姆的因文塔·斯托卡，收集六颗连接宝珠，并把它们安装到切迪安的六家银行里。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:416
msgid ""
"Retrieve the missing relic.\n"
"\n"
"Find Lindisfarne Monastery's missing relic.  Return it to Leffery Caid in the Lindisfarne Monastery when you have retrieved it."
msgstr ""
"找回失落的圣物。\n"
"\n"
"找到林迪斯法恩修道院失落的圣物。找回后交给林迪斯法恩修道院的莱弗里·凯德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:419
msgid ""
"Steal the Golden Honk.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Temple of Honk in Guberland and steal their primary icon, the Golden Honk.  Take it to the goddess Fre in the Hall of the Gods when you have taken it."
msgstr ""
"偷走黄金嘎嘎。\n"
"\n"
"前往古伯兰的嘎嘎神殿，偷走他们最重要的圣像黄金嘎嘎。得手后把它送到众神殿的女神弗蕾那里。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:422
msgid ""
"Clean out the Bathhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Bathhouse in Arslegard and get rid of Ebora and her concubines.  Return to Jokull the Ugly in Arslegard when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"清空浴场。\n"
"\n"
"前往阿斯勒加德的浴场，赶走艾波拉和她的侍妾们。完成后回到阿斯勒加德找丑陋的约库尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:425
msgid ""
"Clean out the Bathhouse.\n"
"\n"
"You got rid of Ebora and her concubines.  Return to Jokull the Ugly in Arslegard."
msgstr ""
"清空浴场。\n"
"\n"
"你赶走了艾波拉和她的侍妾们。回到阿斯勒加德找丑陋的约库尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:428
msgid ""
"Find Gungnir.\n"
"\n"
"Hanndl lost his spear, called Gungnir.  Find it and return it to him."
msgstr ""
"寻找冈格尼尔。\n"
"\n"
"汉恩德尔弄丢了他那杆名为冈格尼尔的长矛。找到它并还给他。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:44
msgid ""
"Rescue Ivsar Forktooth.\n"
"\n"
"General Ivsar Forktooth is being held captive in Drangheim Prison.  Go to Drangheim and break him out.  Return to Jarl Bjarni of Sturmford when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"营救伊夫萨尔·叉牙。\n"
"\n"
"伊夫萨尔·叉牙将军被关押在德朗海姆监狱。前往德朗海姆把他救出来。完成后回去见斯图姆福德的雅尔比亚尔尼。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:47
msgid ""
"Rescue Ivsar Forktooth.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the general.  Now get out of the prison and back to Sturmford.  If you get separated, Ivsar said he'd meet you outside."
msgstr ""
"营救伊夫萨尔·叉牙。\n"
"\n"
"你已救出将军。现在逃出监狱，回到斯图姆福德。如果走散了，伊夫萨尔说他会在外面与你会合。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:5
msgid ""
"Search for anyone living on this island.\n"
"\n"
"The Isle of Ashes is supposed to be uninhabited, but there may be someone here who would help you."
msgstr ""
"寻找岛上的居民。\n"
"\n"
"灰烬岛本该无人居住，但这里也许有人能帮到你。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:50
msgid ""
"Rescue Ivsar Forktooth.\n"
"\n"
"General Ivsar said he knew the way back.  Meet him at the Sturmford City Tavern, and take him to Jarl Bjarni"
msgstr ""
"营救伊夫萨尔·叉牙。\n"
"\n"
"伊夫萨尔将军说他认得回去的路。到斯图姆福德城酒馆与他会合，再把他带去见雅尔比亚尔尼。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:53
msgid ""
"Disable Anskram Keep's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Travel to Anskram Keep in Sturmford and disable it's defenses by opening the portcullis and lowering the drawbridge.  Return to Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"瓦解安斯克拉姆要塞的防御。\n"
"\n"
"前往斯图姆福德的安斯克拉姆要塞，升起闸门、放下吊桥，瓦解它的防御。完成后回去见德朗海姆的雅尔西格蒙德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:56
msgid ""
"Disable Anskram Keep's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"You've disabled Anskram Keep's defenses.  Return to Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim"
msgstr ""
"瓦解安斯克拉姆要塞的防御。\n"
"\n"
"你已瓦解安斯克拉姆要塞的防御。回去见德朗海姆的雅尔西格蒙德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:59
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Crona Kiga from the Chasm of the Dead.\n"
"\n"
"Go to Chasm of the Dead in Drangheim and retrieve the Crona Kiga.  Deliver it to Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim."
msgstr ""
"从亡者深渊取回克罗纳·基加。\n"
"\n"
"前往德朗海姆的亡者深渊，取回克罗纳·基加，并把它交给德朗海姆的雅尔西格蒙德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:62
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Crona Kiga from the Chasm of the Dead.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the Crona Kiga.  Deliver it to Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim."
msgstr ""
"从亡者深渊取回克罗纳·基加。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了克罗纳·基加。把它交给德朗海姆的雅尔西格蒙德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:65
msgid ""
"Get the Book of Rules from the Ta'Sar Academy.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Ta'Sar Academy in Lindisfarne and retrieve the Book of Rules.  Return to Jarl Markel in Guberland when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"从塔萨学院取回规则之书。\n"
"\n"
"前往林迪斯法恩的塔萨学院，取回规则之书。完成后回到古伯兰向雅尔马克尔复命。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:68
msgid ""
"Get the Book of Rules from the Ta'Sar Academy.\n"
"\n"
"You've put the books away.  Now go find the location of the Book of Rules."
msgstr ""
"从塔萨学院取回规则之书。\n"
"\n"
"你已把书都收拾好了。现在去找规则之书所在的位置。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:71
msgid ""
"Get the Book of Rules from the Ta'Sar Academy.\n"
"\n"
"You've got the book.  Return it to Jarl Markel in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"从塔萨学院取回规则之书。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了书。把它交给古伯兰的雅尔马克尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:74
msgid ""
"Beat Ivan the Smart at trivia.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Gathering in Guberland and challenge Ivan the Smart to a trivia contest.  Return to Jarl Markel of Guberland when he is beaten."
msgstr ""
"在问答比赛中击败聪明的伊万。\n"
"\n"
"前往古伯兰的集会所，向聪明的伊万发起问答挑战。击败他后回去见古伯兰的雅尔马克尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:77
msgid ""
"Beat Ivan the Smart at trivia.\n"
"\n"
"You've beaten Ivan the Smart.  Return with the Victory Certificate to Jarl Markel of Guberland."
msgstr ""
"在问答比赛中击败聪明的伊万。\n"
"\n"
"你击败了聪明的伊万。带着胜利证书回去见古伯兰的雅尔马克尔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:8
msgid ""
"Find a way off the island.\n"
"\n"
"There's got to be some way off this rock.  Maybe there are a few inhabitants that could help you."
msgstr ""
"找到离岛的办法。\n"
"\n"
"这块岩石上一定有办法离开。也许有几个居民能帮到你。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:80
msgid ""
"Retrieve Thjorad from Lindisfarne.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Lindisfarne Monastery in Lindisfarne and retrieve the artifact called Thjorad.  Return it to Jarl Sven of Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"从林迪斯法恩取回乔拉德。\n"
"\n"
"前往林迪斯法恩的林迪斯法恩修道院，取回名为乔拉德的神器，并把它交给乔加德的雅尔斯文。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:83
msgid ""
"Retrieve Thjorad from Lindisfarne.\n"
"\n"
"You've got Thjorad.  Now return it to Jarl Sven of Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"从林迪斯法恩取回乔拉德。\n"
"\n"
"你拿到了乔拉德。现在把它交给乔加德的雅尔斯文。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:86
msgid ""
"Find out why the Elemental Thjorad production has stopped.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Thjorad Mine in Thjorgard and find out why they have stopped producing Elemental Thjorad.  Return to Jarl Sven of Thjorgard when they are once again producing Elemental Thjorad."
msgstr ""
"查明元素乔拉德停产的原因。\n"
"\n"
"前往乔加德的乔拉德矿井，查明他们为何停止生产元素乔拉德。等他们恢复生产后，回去见乔加德的雅尔斯文。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:89
msgid ""
"Find the cave-in\n"
"\n"
"A section of the mine is about to cave in.  Find it and see if there is anything you can do about it."
msgstr ""
"找到塌方处\n"
"\n"
"矿井的某一段即将塌方。找到它，看看你能做些什么。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:92
msgid ""
"Break through the hard rock.\n"
"\n"
"There is a section of rock that is too tough for the miner's picks.  Find it and try to break through it."
msgstr ""
"凿穿坚硬的岩层。\n"
"\n"
"有一段岩层太硬，矿工的镐凿不动。找到它，设法凿穿。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:95
msgid ""
"Fix the refinery machine.\n"
"\n"
"The slag extractor is broken.  Find Hjarrand the Fixer in Thjorgard.  He should remember how to fix the machine."
msgstr ""
"修好精炼机。\n"
"\n"
"矿渣提取器坏了。到乔加德去找修理匠亚兰德，他应该记得怎么修这台机器。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/english/quests_overlay.txt:98
msgid ""
"Fix the refinery machine.\n"
"\n"
"You've paid Hjarrand to look at the Machine.  Meet him at the Mine."
msgstr ""
"修好精炼机。\n"
"\n"
"你已付钱请亚兰德查看机器。到矿井与他会合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/hirelings.txt:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/hirelings.txt:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/hirelings.txt:5
msgid "Arrow"
msgstr "箭"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid "Flamberge"
msgstr "波浪剑"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid ""
"This was the type of sword used by the bastard son of the Ursanian Emperor during the earthquakes that tore the Empire apart and the Revolution that followed.  It's wavy blade was thought to cause more damage."
msgstr "这是乌尔萨尼亚皇帝的私生子在撕裂帝国的大地震及随后的革命期间所用的那种剑。人们认为它的波浪形剑刃能造成更大的伤害。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:100
msgid ""
"These boots are made from steel, with leather inside to increase comfort."
msgstr "这双靴子由钢制成，内衬皮革以增加舒适度。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:101
msgid "Sabaton"
msgstr "钢靴"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:101
msgid ""
"These are steel boots made to be worn with a suit of Plate armor. They are made of steel, have leather insoles, and mail to cover the ankle joint."
msgstr "这是与板甲配套穿着的钢靴，钢制靴身，皮革鞋垫，并以锁子甲护住踝关节。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:102
msgid ""
"Old Ursanian for \"Protector of Feet\", the making of these shoes has been lost to history. They are strong, have virtually no break-in period, and have magicial wardings in them to stop your heel from being disconnected from your ankle."
msgstr ""
"“普罗特·德·法塔”在古乌尔萨尼亚语中意为“足之护卫”，这种鞋的制法早已湮没于历史。它们坚固耐用，几乎无需磨合，鞋中还附有魔法护印，免得你的脚跟与脚踝分家。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:102
msgid "Prote der Fatta"
msgstr "普罗特·德·法塔"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:103 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:105
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:106 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:107 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:108
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:109 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:110 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:111
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:165 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:186 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:196
msgid "Gloves"
msgstr "手套"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:103
msgid ""
"These gloves are more often seen at the Thing than in combat. Nonetheless, they offer better protection than a bare hand."
msgstr "这种手套更多见于民会而非战场。尽管如此，它们仍比光着的手多一层防护。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:104
msgid "Leather Gauntlets"
msgstr "皮制护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:104
msgid ""
"These hardened leather gauntlets have articulated fingers, and a softer leather palm for better feel of the weapon"
msgstr "这种硬化皮革护手的指节可活动，掌心采用较软的皮革，握武器时手感更好。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:105
msgid "Mail Gauntlets"
msgstr "锁子护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:105
msgid ""
"These gloves have a leather palm, and are backed with mail. They don't quite fit properly, but are effective for stopping glancing blows from doing serious damage."
msgstr "这种手套掌心为皮革，背面覆以锁子甲。它们不太合手，但足以防止擦过的打击造成严重伤害。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:106
msgid ""
"These steel gauntlets are the first major step in protecting the hand. They are a major step up from mail gauntlets, offering more protection, while not sacrificing much flexibility."
msgstr "这种钢制护手是保护双手的第一大步。比起锁子护手，它们防护更强，又不会过多牺牲灵活性。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:107
msgid "Exceptional Mail Gauntlets"
msgstr "精良锁子护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:107
msgid ""
"These mail gauntlets are made of a resilient alloy whose secret is only known to the mailsmiths. It's flexibility and strength makes this gauntlet offer great protection."
msgstr "这种锁子护手以一种韧性极佳的合金制成，其秘方只有锁甲匠知晓。它的灵活与坚固使其能提供极佳的防护。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:108
msgid "Superior Steel Gauntlets"
msgstr "上等钢制护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:108
msgid ""
"These gauntlets are made from the finest steel available. Each finger is seperately articulated, and the rivits holding them in place are of the highest quality. You would he hard pressed to find better armor for the hand than this."
msgstr "这种护手以最上乘的钢材打造。每根手指都可单独活动，固定它们的铆钉也是最高品质。你很难找到比这更好的手部护具了。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:109
msgid ""
"Old Ursanian for \"Protector of Hands\"  These gloves are copied from pictures in tapestries and plates from centuries ago. They offer a great deal of protection, but it is certain, as many scholars attest, these copies are no match for the originals."
msgstr ""
"“普罗特·德·汉内”在古乌尔萨尼亚语中意为“手之护卫”。这些手套仿自数百年前挂毯与碟盘上的图样。它们的防护相当出色，但正如许多学者所言，这些仿品必定远不及原作。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:109
msgid "Prote der Hanne"
msgstr "普罗特·德·汉内"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "The Chopper"
msgstr "劈砍者"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid ""
"The Chopper was originally a ritual sword until it was discovered it had surprising military value."
msgstr "劈砍者原本是一柄仪式用剑，直到人们发现它有着出人意料的军事价值。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:110
msgid "Processional Gauntlets"
msgstr "仪仗护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:110
msgid ""
"These gauntlets are used more for parades and Stately matters than for fighting. Yet they were designed for combat. They are comfortable, sharp looking, and keep your hands safe."
msgstr "这种护手多用于游行和庄重场合，而非战斗。不过它们本是为战斗设计的：舒适，外观锐利，也能保护你的双手。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:111
msgid "Magreeb Gauntlets"
msgstr "马格里卜护手"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:111
msgid ""
"These gauntlets are so named because they resemble the claw like arm of the Magreeb. Despite the fancified claws, they are still flexible and strong. The claws on them are also very sharp, and could possibly be used as a weapon themselves."
msgstr "这种护手得名于它与马格里卜爪状前肢的相似。尽管爪子是装饰性的，它们依然灵活而坚固。上面的利爪也十分锋利，甚至可以当作武器使用。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:112
msgid "Footman's Buckler"
msgstr "步兵小圆盾"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:112
msgid ""
"Mass produced for the Arena, the Footman's Buckler was quickly adopted for use during the Clan Wars."
msgstr "步兵小圆盾最初是为竞技场批量生产的，很快就在氏族战争期间被广泛采用。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:113
msgid ""
"This small round shield is cheap, and easy to make. It's price makes it very popular."
msgstr "这面小圆盾便宜，也容易制造。低廉的价格使它十分受欢迎。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:114
msgid ""
"The favored shield of the Jarls of Chedian, the Kite shield provides better protection than the Footman's Buckler.  It is often painted with the Jarl's Bindrune."
msgstr "风筝盾是切迪安雅尔们的心头好，防护比步兵小圆盾更好。盾面上常绘有雅尔的绑定符文。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:115
msgid "Heater"
msgstr "心形盾"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:115
msgid ""
"This medium sized shield is a favorite of Mercenaries. It is made of wood, and reinforced with steel."
msgstr "这种中型盾牌深受佣兵喜爱。它以木头制成，并用钢加固。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:116
msgid "Pavise"
msgstr "大型立盾"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:116
msgid ""
"This is the shield used by crossbowmen to protect themselves while reloading their weapon"
msgstr "这是弩手在装填武器时用来掩护自己的盾牌。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:117
msgid "Ronenguard Shield"
msgstr "罗嫩卫盾"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:117
msgid ""
"This is the sheild used most often by the Ronenhall Guard. It is made of solid steel. It is heavier than most other sheilds, but the strong members of the Ronenhall Guard use it very well."
msgstr "这是罗嫩霍尔卫队最常使用的盾牌，由实心钢制成。它比大多数盾牌都重，但罗嫩霍尔卫队的壮汉们用起来得心应手。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:118
msgid ""
"Literally, Old Ursanian for \"Soldier Protector\"  These shields were found in an abandon warehouse in the Old Ursana. They are rare, and exceptionally strong."
msgstr "字面意思是古乌尔萨尼亚语中的“士兵的护卫”。这些盾牌是在古乌尔萨纳一座废弃的仓库里发现的，十分稀有，而且异常坚固。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:118
msgid "Prote der Solle"
msgstr "普罗特·德·索勒"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:119
msgid "Haklea Shovis"
msgstr "哈克莱亚·肖维斯"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:119
msgid ""
"This shield comes from a shipment of shields that washed up on Lachmon Cove from an unknown shipwreck. It's name is derived from the words written on the side of the crates. It's origins and history are not known, but it is one of the strongest and lightest shields you can carry."
msgstr ""
"这面盾牌来自一批在拉赫蒙湾被冲上岸的盾牌，沉船来历不明。它的名字取自箱子侧面所写的字样。它的来历和历史无人知晓，但它是你能携带的最坚固也最轻便的盾牌之一。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "Stiletto"
msgstr "三棱匕首"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "This dagger is designed for stabbing and piercing mail."
msgstr "这种匕首专为刺击和穿透锁子甲而设计。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:120
msgid "Peasant Belt"
msgstr "农夫腰带"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:120
msgid "This belt is commonly seen all over Chedian."
msgstr "这种腰带在切迪安各地随处可见。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:121
msgid "Fancy Belt"
msgstr "华丽腰带"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:121
msgid ""
"This belt is often sold by merchants to lower classes, who often try to copy the fashion of the Jarls."
msgstr "商人常把这种腰带卖给下层民众，他们总想模仿雅尔们的时尚。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:122
msgid "Soldier's Belt"
msgstr "士兵腰带"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:122
msgid ""
"This is the belt most often seen worn by soldiers in Framon to hold their swords up."
msgstr "这是弗拉蒙的士兵最常系的腰带，用来吊住他们的剑。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:123
msgid "Regal Belt"
msgstr "王者腰带"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:123
msgid "This belt is a symbol of nobility and is often worn to show status."
msgstr "这条腰带是贵族身份的象征，常被佩戴以彰显地位。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:124
msgid "Dragon Belt"
msgstr "巨龙腰带"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:124
msgid ""
"This Belt was made from the scales of a dragon. It is sturdy, and nearly unbreakable."
msgstr "这条腰带以巨龙的鳞片制成，坚固耐用，几乎坚不可摧。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:125
msgid "Iron Ring"
msgstr "铁戒指"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:125
msgid "Not the most fancy of jewelry, this is a simple ring made of iron."
msgstr "算不上华美的首饰，只是一枚朴素的铁戒指。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:126
msgid "This is a small gold band, popular with the Chedian nobles."
msgstr "这是一枚小巧的金戒圈，深受切迪安贵族喜爱。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:127
msgid "Puzzle Ring"
msgstr "谜题戒指"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:127
msgid ""
"The initial design of the puzzle ring was made by the Archmage Jesper, who found that the twisted puzzle like ring was very susceptible to enchantment."
msgstr "谜题戒指最初由大法师耶斯佩设计，他发现这种扭曲如谜题般的戒指极易附魔。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:128
msgid "A large, lovely pearl adorns this otherwise unremarkable ring."
msgstr "一颗硕大可爱的珍珠点缀着这枚本来平平无奇的戒指。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:129
msgid "Diamond Ring"
msgstr "钻石戒指"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:129
msgid "Simple gold band with several fat diamonds mounted in it."
msgstr "朴素的金戒圈上镶嵌着数颗硕大的钻石。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid "Elite Dagger"
msgstr "精英匕首"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid "Standard issue dagger of the Drangheim Prison guards."
msgstr "德朗海姆监狱守卫的制式匕首。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:130
msgid ""
"Plain Bronze Amulet, probably meant as a blank for some other design. Not worth much."
msgstr "朴素的青铜护身符，大概原本是用来作其他设计的坯料，不值什么钱。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:131
msgid "Lightly decorated platinum amulet."
msgstr "装饰简朴的白金护身符。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:131
msgid "Platinum Amulet"
msgstr "白金护身符"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:132
msgid "Gemmed Amulet"
msgstr "宝石护身符"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:132
msgid "Golden amulet shaped as a star, encrusted with gems."
msgstr "星形的金质护身符，上面镶满宝石。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:133
msgid ""
"This amulet was cast to resemble the face of a now-unknown Warrior-God."
msgstr "这枚护身符铸成了一位如今已无人知晓的战神的面容。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:133
msgid "Warrior Amulet"
msgstr "战士护身符"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:134
msgid ""
"Made from elemental Thjorad by Thjoradric Smiths. It is of a very high quality."
msgstr "由乔拉德工匠以元素乔拉德打造，品质极高。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:134
msgid "Thjoradric Amulet"
msgstr "乔拉德护身符"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:135
msgid "Sing Sword"
msgstr "吟唱之剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:135
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This sword was enchanted by an unknown mage for the doctor turned skald known as Frank.  It is said to cast a pleasing tone in battle, causing the weilder to become stronger. (Effects: +30 to Might; of Arms Mastery)"
msgid ""
"This sword was enchanted by an unknown mage for the doctor turned skald known as Frank.  It is said to cast a pleasing tone in battle, causing the wielder to become stronger. (Effects: +30 Might, +5 Armsmaster)"
msgstr ""
"这把剑由一位不知名的法师为那位弃医从吟的诗人弗兰克附魔。据说它在战斗中会发出悦耳的音调，令持剑者变得更加强壮。（效果：力量 +30；武器大师）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:136
msgid "Excala Banna"
msgstr "艾克斯卡拉·班纳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:136
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This yellow-hued sword is legendary among the native people of Frosgard.  They claim that it was carried by their hero Eric, who it seemed was never prepared for battle.  It is supposed to have surfaced from a lake when Eric cried out, \"Yoohoo!\" (Effects: -5 Accuracy, +15 Endurance, +50 Luck)"
msgid ""
"This yellow-hued sword is legendary among the native people of Frosgard.  They claim that it was carried by their hero Eric, who it seemed was never prepared for battle.  It is supposed to have surfaced from a lake when Eric cried out, \"Yoohoo!\" (Effects: +15 Endurance, -5 Accuracy, +50 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"这把黄色的剑在弗罗斯加德的原住民中是传奇。他们声称这是英雄埃里克所持之物，而他似乎从来没有为战斗做好准备。据说当埃里克高喊“呦呵！”时，它便从湖中浮出水面。（效果：准确 -5，耐力 +15，运气 +50）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:137
msgid "Mevan Sword"
msgstr "梅万之剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:137
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The Mevan Sword is pure evil.  It surfaced early this century, after being buried under a pile of rubble since the Great Cataclysm.  It is not known who made it, or why, but most who have used it either swore by it or died by it. (Effects: Breaks after first use)"
msgid ""
"The Mevan Sword is pure evil.  It surfaced early this century, after being buried under a pile of rubble since the Great Cataclysm.  It is not known who made it, or why, but most who have used it either swore by it or died by it. (Effects: Breaks after its first attack)"
msgstr ""
"梅万之剑是纯粹的邪恶之物。自大灾变以来它一直被埋在瓦砾堆下，直到本世纪初才重见天日。无人知晓是谁铸造了它，又为何而铸，但大多数用过它的人，不是对它推崇备至，就是死在它的锋刃之下。（效果：首次使用后损坏）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:138
msgid "Jorhgamesh"
msgstr "约尔加梅什"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:138
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Jorhgamesh was comissioned by Olaf the Fat during his short reign as Jarl of Frosgard.  He believed that with this sword he could conquer and unite all the Clans of Chedian (Effects: +10 to Speed, +20 to Accuracy, -50 to SP)"
msgid ""
"Jorhgamesh was commissioned by Olaf the Fat during his short reign as Jarl of Frosgard.  He believed that with this sword he could conquer and unite all the Clans of Chedian. (Effects: +40 Speed, +40 Accuracy, -50 SP)"
msgstr ""
"约尔加梅什是胖子奥拉夫在他短暂担任弗罗斯加德雅尔期间下令打造的。他相信凭借这把剑，自己能够征服并统一切迪安的所有氏族。（效果：速度 +10，准确 +20，魔法值 -50）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:139
msgid "Black's Heart"
msgstr "黑色之心"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:139
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Long ago, there was a group of Chedian warriors lead by a man named Halfred the Black.  This dagger was his constant companion.  After his death, the dagger was buried with him.  His grave however was soon looted, it's contents taken and sold. (Effects: Increased damage, Increased chance to hit, Increased speed)"
msgid ""
"Long ago, there was a group of Chedian warriors led by a man named Halfred the Black.  This dagger was his constant companion.  After his death, the dagger was buried with him.  His grave however was soon looted, its contents taken and sold. (Effects: +20 to hit, +10 damage, faster recovery)"
msgstr ""
"很久以前，有一队由名叫黑色哈夫雷德的男子率领的切迪安战士。这把匕首是他形影不离的伙伴。他死后，匕首与他一同下葬。然而他的坟墓很快就被洗劫，陪葬品被取走变卖。（效果：伤害提高、命中几率提高、速度提高）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "Baselard"
msgstr "巴塞拉德短剑"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "This dagger is often worn by peasants."
msgstr "这种匕首常被农民佩戴。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:140
msgid "Integris"
msgstr "因特格里斯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:140
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Named after the Old Ursanian Emperor who commited suicide in 225 BC, this is the dagger that he used to finally end his life.  Emperor Integris was often called the \"Suicidal Emperor\" because of his many attempts to end his own life.  Ironically, on most of his attempts, the weapon broke in his hand before he could complete the task. (Effects: +15 pts of Poison damage; Reputed +35 to hit and damage)"
msgid ""
"Named after the Old Ursanian Emperor who committed suicide in 225 BC, this is the dagger that he used to finally end his life.  Emperor Integris was often called the \"Suicidal Emperor\" because of his many attempts to end his own life.  Ironically, on most of his attempts, the weapon broke in his hand before he could complete the task. (Effects: +20 to hit, +15 damage, +15 poison damage per hit)"
msgstr ""
"以公元前225年自尽的古乌尔萨尼亚皇帝命名，这正是他最终结束自己生命时用的匕首。因特格里斯皇帝因多次试图自尽而常被称为“自杀皇帝”。具有讽刺意味的是，他大多数尝试都因武器在他手中断裂而未能完成。（效果：+15点毒素伤害；据传命中与伤害 +35）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:141
msgid "Bloodaxe"
msgstr "血斧"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:141
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This axe is named after the Sturmford warrior Sven Bloodaxe who was ever victorious in combat.  Although it is denied by many, he finally died in 340 AC of old age. (Effects: +10 to all resistances; 40% chance to \"poison\" target at GM level.)"
msgid ""
"This axe is named after the Sturmford warrior Sven Bloodaxe who was ever victorious in combat.  Although it is denied by many, he finally died in 340 AC of old age. (Effects: +30 Endurance, +10 to all resistances, 40% chance to poison the target at Grandmaster)"
msgstr ""
"这把斧头以斯图姆福德战士斯文·血斧命名，他在战斗中战无不胜。尽管许多人对此予以否认，但他最终于公元340年死于高龄。（效果：所有抗性 +10；宗师级时有40%几率令目标“中毒”。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:142
msgid "Sygnir"
msgstr "西格尼尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:142
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This axe was forged 200 BC in Minespring.  The dwarves of that era were exceptional at their ability to create incredible weapons.  In 73 AC, Ichvan I tried to convince the dwarves to begin making weapons for his new Mendossian Army.  After 2 years of negotiation, Ichvan tired of their refusals and razed Minespring. (Effects: Extra damage; +6 Armsmaster, +6 Blade skill; of Regeneration)"
msgid ""
"This axe was forged 200 BC in Minespring.  The dwarves of that era were exceptional at their ability to create incredible weapons.  In 73 AC, Ichvan I tried to convince the dwarves to begin making weapons for his new Mendossian Army.  After 2 years of negotiation, Ichvan tired of their refusals and razed Minespring. (Effects: +6 Axe, +6 Armsmaster, +10 damage per hit, regenerates HP)"
msgstr ""
"这把斧头于公元前200年锻造于矿泉镇。那个年代的矮人极其擅长打造不可思议的武器。公元73年，伊奇万一世试图说服矮人为他新建的门多西亚军队制造武器。经过两年谈判，伊奇万厌倦了他们的拒绝，夷平了矿泉镇。（效果：额外伤害；武器大师 +6，剑术 +6；再生）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:143
msgid "Everstrike"
msgstr "永击"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:143
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Made of Elemental Thjorad, this weapon was one of the finest creations from the famed weaponsmith Borfinn Ironhands.  He always claimed he was not adept at making missle throwers, but this weapon is clearly the finest example of anything he ever made. (Effects: 100% accuracy)"
msgid ""
"Made of Elemental Thjorad, this weapon was one of the finest creations from the famed weaponsmith Borfinn Ironhands.  He always claimed he was not adept at making missile throwers, but this weapon is clearly the finest example of anything he ever made. (Effects: +5 Bow, faster recovery, always hits)"
msgstr ""
"这件武器以元素乔拉德制成，是著名武器匠博尔芬·铁手最出色的作品之一。他总是声称自己不擅长制造远程武器，但这件武器显然是他所有作品中最杰出的典范。（效果：100%准确）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:144
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This dagger was given to Aesir the Scholar as a reward in the Thronish town of Nirheim.  She spent most of her life travelling from town to town across Chedian healing children and teaching her skills to townsfolks.  A Merchant gave up his prized dagger as a gift for saving the life of his son. (Effects: +100 HP; Slow; 3 attacks)"
msgid ""
"This dagger was given to Aesir the Scholar as a reward in the Thronish town of Nirheim.  She spent most of her life travelling from town to town across Chedian healing children and teaching her skills to townsfolks.  A Merchant gave up his prized dagger as a gift for saving the life of his son. (Effects: +100 HP, slower recovery, three projectiles per throw)"
msgstr ""
"这把匕首是索隆海姆小镇尼尔海姆赠予学者埃西尔的报酬。她一生中大部分时间在切迪安各城镇间奔走，治愈孩童，并向镇民传授自己的技艺。一位商人因她救了自己儿子的性命，献出了他最珍爱的匕首作为谢礼。（效果：生命值 +100；缓慢；3次攻击）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:144
msgid "Trolleri"
msgstr "特罗勒里"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:145
msgid "Tillhygge"
msgstr "蒂尔许格"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:145
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Tillhygge was unearthed on the Isle of Ashes in 75 AC when a group of Scavengers were picking through the remains of Verhoffin's Tower.  When they returned to the mainland, they claimed it to be haunted by the ghost of Verhoffin himself and soon sold the axe. (Effects: +10 Might, +30 Accuracy; of Disease, of Mastery)"
msgid ""
"Tillhygge was unearthed on the Isle of Ashes in 75 AC when a group of Scavengers were picking through the remains of Verhoffin's Tower.  When they returned to the mainland, they claimed it to be haunted by the ghost of Verhoffin himself and soon sold the axe. (Effects: +10 Might, +30 Accuracy, +5 Repair Item, +5 disease damage per hit)"
msgstr ""
"蒂尔许格于公元75年在灰烬岛出土，当时一群拾荒者正在维尔霍芬之塔的残骸中翻找。他们回到大陆后，声称它被维尔霍芬本人的幽灵所缠绕，不久便将这把斧头卖掉了。（效果：力量 +10，准确 +30；疾病、精通）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:146
msgid "Kraftig Bage"
msgstr "强壮之弓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:146
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This bow was carried into battle by the mighty warrior Halfnorr the Ox-Shouldered.  It conferred upon him great strength and skill.  He was slain by another warrior, Sven Bloodaxe, when they met in battle in Thjorgard. (Effects: +10 to all stats; +7 Bow)"
msgid ""
"This bow was carried into battle by the mighty warrior Halfnorr the Ox-Shouldered.  It conferred upon him great strength and skill.  He was slain by another warrior, Sven Bloodaxe, when they met in battle in Thjorgard. (Effects: +10 to all stats, +7 Bow)"
msgstr ""
"这把弓曾被强大的战士牛肩哈夫诺尔带上战场，赋予了他强大的力量与技巧。他在乔加德的一场战斗中，被另一位战士斯文·血斧所杀。（效果：所有属性 +10；弓箭 +7）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:147
msgid "Blackpowder"
msgstr "黑火药"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:147
msgid "Hand Cannon"
msgstr "手持火炮"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:147
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This device was created by the mad scholar Roj'ere sometime before his death in 320 AC.  He was called a genius by some, a madman by others.  This paticular invetion uses a strange black powder to propel a projectile from it's muzzle.  Roj'ere was extremely proud of this invention, but died before he could refine it and make it safer to use. (Effects: Bypass opponent's AC, Extra damage, Slow recovery, 2% Chance per use of breaking and causing damage to player.)"
msgid ""
"This device was created by the mad scholar Roj'ere sometime before his death in 320 AC.  He was called a genius by some, a madman by others.  This particular invention uses a strange black powder to propel a projectile from its muzzle.  Roj'ere was extremely proud of this invention, but died before he could refine it and make it safer to use. (Effects: +15 damage per hit, slower recovery, halves the target's AC, 2% chance per shot to break and hurt the wielder)"
msgstr ""
"这件装置由疯狂的学者罗热尔在他公元320年去世前的某个时候制造。有人称他为天才，也有人称他为疯子。这件发明借助一种奇特的黑色粉末，将弹丸从枪口推射出去。罗热尔对这项发明极为自豪，却在来得及改进并使之更安全之前就去世了。（效果：无视对手防御；额外伤害；恢复缓慢；每次使用有2%几率损坏并伤及使用者。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:148
msgid "Gungnir"
msgstr "冈格尼尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:148
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Gungnir was fashioned by Hanndl himself to serve as his weapon during the Great Reckoning that is fated to happen one day.  On the day Krohn forsaw the coming of this day, he demanded all his gods arm themselves with weapons of great power.  Somehow, Hanndl's spear surfaced in Chedian (Effects: of puncturing (20% chance to bypass opponent's AC).  Extra Damage)"
msgid ""
"Gungnir was fashioned by Hanndl himself to serve as his weapon during the Great Reckoning that is fated to happen one day.  On the day Krohn foresaw the coming of this day, he demanded all his gods arm themselves with weapons of great power.  Somehow, Hanndl's spear surfaced in Chedian. (Effects: +15 damage per hit, 20% chance to ignore the target's AC)"
msgstr ""
"冈格尼尔是汉恩德尔亲自打造的，用作他在注定终有一天会降临的大清算之战中的武器。克罗恩预见这一天来临之时，要求他所有的神明都以强大的武器武装自己。不知为何，汉恩德尔的长矛竟出现在了切迪安。（效果：穿刺（20%几率无视对手防御）；额外伤害）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:149
msgid "Formanir"
msgstr "福马尼尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:149
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This spear was cast over the heads of the Tredskas rebels by Krohn himself when they rebelled against the gods and tried to capture Arslegard.  Desipte their leader being one of the most powerful magicians of the time, and the army made up of hundreds of thousands of skilled warriors, not a single Tredskas rebel left the battlefield that day.  Krohn left this spear behind as a warning to mortals who thought to rebel. (Effects: -10 to AC, +30 Might, -10 Endurance; Grandmaster's, of Permanance.)"
msgid ""
"This spear was cast over the heads of the Tredskas rebels by Krohn himself when they rebelled against the gods and tried to capture Arslegard.  Despite their leader being one of the most powerful magicians of the time, and the army made up of hundreds of thousands of skilled warriors, not a single Tredskas rebel left the battlefield that day.  Krohn left this spear behind as a warning to mortals who thought to rebel. (Effects: +50 Might, -10 Endurance, -10 AC, +5 Spear)"
msgstr ""
"当特雷德斯卡叛军反抗众神并试图攻占阿斯勒加德时，克罗恩亲自将这支长矛掷于他们头顶。尽管他们的首领是当时最强大的魔法师之一，军队更是由数十万名技艺精湛的战士组成，那一天却没有一个特雷德斯卡叛军活着离开战场。克罗恩留下这支长矛，以警告那些妄想反叛的凡人。（效果：防御 -10，力量 +30，耐力 -10；宗师、恒久。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid "Chedian Dirk"
msgstr "切迪安短剑"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid ""
"This dagger is the Chedian's constant companion.  Should he ever have to go somewhere without his sword, he would take this dagger with him."
msgstr "这把匕首是切迪安人形影不离的伙伴。即便要出门不带剑，他也会带上这把匕首。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:150
msgid "Einherjar"
msgstr "英灵战士"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:150
msgid ""
"This halberd is said to carry with it the souls of men slain by it.  It has an unusual effect on those wielding it.  Its first owner was said to have gone mad.  It's second owner gave it away and threw himself from a cliff.  The tales of tragedy this halberd carries are long and sad. (Effects: +40 Might, Vampiric, 10% chance of insanity each week, 10% chance each week to lose a tenth of HP)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:151
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Literally Old Ursanian for \"Stick Cutter\" This is the only surviving example left.  It was used by the Ursanian Persana Garda, the men who were personally responsible for the Emperor's safety.  This weapon contributed in no small part to the fear the Persana Garda put in the hearts of men. (Effects: +30 Might, +10 Endurance; 5% chance to cast \"Enrage\" on target at GM level.)"
msgid ""
"Literally Old Ursanian for \"Stick Cutter\" This is the only surviving example left.  It was used by the Ursanian Persana Garda, the men who were personally responsible for the Emperor's safety.  This weapon contributed in no small part to the fear the Persana Garda put in the hearts of men. (Effects: +30 Might, +10 Endurance, 5% chance to enrage the target at Grandmaster)"
msgstr ""
"字面意思是古乌尔萨尼亚语的“劈棍者”。这是现存唯一的一件。它曾被乌尔萨尼亚的佩尔萨纳卫队使用，这些人亲自负责皇帝的安全。这件武器在佩尔萨纳卫队令人闻风丧胆的名声中功不可没。（效果：力量 +30，耐力 +10；宗师级时有5%几率对目标施放“激怒”。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:151
msgid "Stouka Couta"
msgstr "斯托卡·考塔"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:152
msgid "Vanir's Hammer"
msgstr "瓦尼尔之锤"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:152
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Vanir's Hammer was created by the legendary sorcerer Vanir several hundred years ago.  He was as adept at wielding this weapon as he was at sorcery.  Many people comment how this is not a hammer, but a cudgel, to which Vanir would reply \"But what is a hammer?  Does the name matter if it can crush skulls?\"  Not many on the receiving end of his hammer argued with him. (Effects: +30 Might, +10 Endurance; 5% Chance to cast \"Enrage\" on target at GM level.)"
msgid ""
"Vanir's Hammer was created by the legendary sorcerer Vanir several hundred years ago.  He was as adept at wielding this weapon as he was at sorcery.  Many people comment how this is not a hammer, but a cudgel, to which Vanir would reply \"But what is a hammer?  Does the name matter if it can crush skulls?\"  Not many on the receiving end of his hammer argued with him. (Effects: +30 Might, +10 Endurance, 5% chance to enrage the target at Grandmaster)"
msgstr ""
"瓦尼尔之锤是数百年前由传奇巫师瓦尼尔所造。他挥舞这件武器的本领不亚于施展巫术。许多人评论说这根本不是锤子，而是根短棍，对此瓦尼尔会回答：“可什么才是锤子？只要能砸碎头骨，名字有什么要紧？”被他的锤子砸中的人，没几个还能与他争辩。（效果：力量 +30，耐力 +10；宗师级时有5%几率对目标施放“激怒”。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:153
msgid "Blutterbunger"
msgstr "布吕特邦格"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:153
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Blutterbunger was a popular weapon in 480 AC when it was discovered.  It has the ability to confound an opponent, making it extremly popular in barroom brawls as well as on the battlefield.  It was owned by Fyri the Goat-Face until, in a barfight, he somehow managed to hit himself with it and knocked himself unconscious. (Effects: of Bruisers; 5% chance of stunning opponent.  If fail vs skill 70% chance knocking self unconscious.)"
msgid ""
"Blutterbunger was a popular weapon in 480 AC when it was discovered.  It has the ability to confound an opponent, making it extremely popular in barroom brawls as well as on the battlefield.  It was owned by Fyri the Goat-Face until, in a barfight, he somehow managed to hit himself with it and knocked himself unconscious. (Effects: +40 Might, +20 Endurance, +5 Mace, 5% chance to stun the target, 70% chance to knock the wielder unconscious when a hit does not stun)"
msgstr ""
"布吕特邦格在公元480年被发现时，是一件颇受欢迎的武器。它能令对手晕头转向，因此在酒馆斗殴和战场上都极受欢迎。它曾属于山羊脸菲里，直到在一次酒馆斗殴中，他不知怎的用它打中了自己，把自己打晕了过去。（效果：打手；5%几率击晕对手。若技能检定失败，有70%几率把自己打晕。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:154
msgid "Manarus"
msgstr "玛纳鲁斯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:154
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This morning star is named after the mythical hero Manarus who became the guiding star in the northern sky.  The history of this weapon is not known, but it is said to bestow great skill on magic users. (Effects: +80 SP; The Grandmaster's, of the Jajarb)"
msgid ""
"This morning star is named after the mythical hero Manarus who became the guiding star in the northern sky.  The history of this weapon is not known, but it is said to bestow great skill on magic users. (Effects: +30 Intellect, +30 Personality, +80 SP, +5 Mace)"
msgstr ""
"这把晨星锤以神话英雄玛纳鲁斯命名，他后来成为北方天空中的引路之星。这件武器的历史无人知晓，但据说它能赋予魔法使用者极高的技艺。（效果：魔法值 +80；宗师、贾贾布）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:155
msgid "Samarjit"
msgstr "萨玛吉特"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:155
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This staff is made of an unknown metal.  It is surprisingly light, and also very, very old.  It was found with documents written in Old Ursanian that suggest it predates even the earliest mention of the Ursanian Empire.  Not even the documents explain who made it, how they made it, or where it came from. (Effects: +80 Might, +20 Endurance, -20 Speed; of Permanance, Master's)"
msgid ""
"This staff is made of an unknown metal.  It is surprisingly light, and also very, very old.  It was found with documents written in Old Ursanian that suggest it predates even the earliest mention of the Ursanian Empire.  Not even the documents explain who made it, how they made it, or where it came from. (Effects: +80 Might, +20 Endurance, -20 Speed, +3 Staff)"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖由一种未知的金属制成。它出奇地轻，而且非常非常古老。与它一同发现的古乌尔萨尼亚语文献表明，它的年代甚至早于乌尔萨尼亚帝国最早的记载。就连这些文献也没有说明是谁、如何制造了它，或它来自何处。（效果：力量 +80，耐力 +20，速度 -20；恒久、大师）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:156
msgid "Maul"
msgstr "毛尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:156
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This maul first appeared about 10 years AC, when most people were still picking up the pieces of the Great Cataclysm.  It is said to be made out of pure Elemental Thjorad, and is very, very heavy.  Many smiths have tried to copy this maul, and have only suceeded in making very heavy magic items. (Effects: 5-15 pts of Elemental Damage.  10% Chance of killing target.)"
msgid ""
"This maul first appeared about 10 years AC, when most people were still picking up the pieces of the Great Cataclysm.  It is said to be made out of pure Elemental Thjorad, and is very, very heavy.  Many smiths have tried to copy this maul, and have only succeeded in making very heavy magic items. (Effects: +10 damage per hit, 10% chance to kill the target outright)"
msgstr ""
"这把大锤大约在公元10年左右首次出现，当时大多数人还在大灾变的废墟中收拾残局。据说它由纯粹的元素乔拉德制成，非常非常沉重。许多铁匠试图仿制这把大锤，却只造出了非常沉重的魔法物品。（效果：5-15点元素伤害；10%几率秒杀目标。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:157
msgid "Spencer's Obedience"
msgstr "斯宾塞的服从"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:157
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the club that General Spencer used to keep his troops in line.  He often found them playing card games intstead of staying at their posts, so he had this magical club created to \"inspire\" them to do their jobs.  It proved to be very effective. (Effects: +10 to Speed; of the Reel)"
msgid ""
"This is the club that General Spencer used to keep his troops in line.  He often found them playing card games instead of staying at their posts, so he had this magical club created to \"inspire\" them to do their jobs.  It proved to be very effective. (Effects: +20 Might, +30 Speed, stuns the target on every hit)"
msgstr ""
"这是斯宾塞将军用来管教部下的棍棒。他常发现士兵们不在岗位上，反而在玩纸牌游戏，于是命人打造了这根魔法棍棒来“激励”他们尽职尽责。事实证明它非常有效。（效果：速度 +10；摇摆）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:158
msgid "Mjulnir"
msgstr "姆尤尔尼尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:158
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Mjulnir is often called \"The Hammer of the Gods\" and for good reason.  It is said that the god Krohn lost it when he hurled it at his wife after a quarrel.  It is a massive weapon, meant to be wielded by a massive warrior.  It is also rumored that Krohn has vowed to reclaim his weapon, and destroy the man who has kept it from him. (Effects: -20 Speed; 16-25 pts of Elemental Damage.  Divine Intervention will always fail.)"
msgid ""
"Mjulnir is often called \"The Hammer of the Gods\" and for good reason.  It is said that the god Krohn lost it when he hurled it at his wife after a quarrel.  It is a massive weapon, meant to be wielded by a massive warrior.  It is also rumored that Krohn has vowed to reclaim his weapon, and destroy the man who has kept it from him. (Effects: +50 Might, -20 Speed, +20 damage per hit, Divine Intervention always fails)"
msgstr ""
"姆尤尔尼尔常被称为“众神之锤”，这是有道理的。据说神明克罗恩在与妻子争吵后将它掷向她，从而遗失了它。它是一件庞大的武器，只有身躯庞大的战士才能挥舞。也有传言说克罗恩发誓要夺回他的武器，并消灭夺走它的人。（效果：速度 -20；16-25点元素伤害；普渡众生必定失败。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:159
msgid "Igdrasine"
msgstr "伊格德拉辛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:159
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Legend has it this armor was a gift from Igrassa herself to Dagna Kramartrag, for his service to her temple. (Effects: +10 to Magic)"
msgid ""
"Legend has it this armor was a gift from Igrassa herself to Dagna Kramartrag, for his service to her temple. (Effects: +30 Intellect, +30 Personality)"
msgstr "传说这件铠甲是伊格拉莎亲自赐给达格纳·克拉马特拉格的礼物，以酬谢他对她神殿的服务。（效果：魔法 +10）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid ""
"This dagger is weighted and balanced for throwing.  Like the other throwing weapons found in Chedian, it is magically enchanted to return."
msgstr "这把匕首经过配重和平衡，适合投掷。和切迪安发现的其他投掷武器一样，它被附魔后能够自动飞回。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:144 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid "Throwing Dagger"
msgstr "投掷匕首"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:160
msgid "Poltergeist"
msgstr "骚灵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:160
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This armor was allegedly made from the chains some ghosts carry with them.  Whether it is true or not, it certainly has some ghostly properties.  It weighs nearly nothing at all, and carries with it a foreboding cloud.  It also seems to make the same sound as the poor souls who are chained to the place of their death. (Effects: of Regeneration; 10% chance of opponent becoming afraid.)"
msgid ""
"This armor was allegedly made from the chains some ghosts carry with them.  Whether it is true or not, it certainly has some ghostly properties.  It weighs nearly nothing at all, and carries with it a foreboding cloud.  It also seems to make the same sound as the poor souls who are chained to the place of their death. (Effects: +30 Speed, regenerates HP, 10% chance to frighten the target on a hit)"
msgstr ""
"据说这件铠甲是用某些幽灵随身携带的锁链制成。无论是否属实，它确实具有一些幽灵般的特性。它几乎没有重量，周身笼罩着不祥的阴云，还似乎会发出与那些被锁在死亡之地的可怜灵魂相同的声响。（效果：再生；10%几率使对手陷入恐惧。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:161
msgid "Swordsbane"
msgstr "剑克星"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:161
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This armor was worn by Leit the Crusader during his reign as leader of the Thronheim Clan.  It was with this armor he slayed the foul creatures that inhabited the area that would become Thronheim City.  It is said to prevent sword from ever touching skin. (Effects: +40 AC vs melee attacks, -10 AC vs ranged attacks)"
msgid ""
"This armor was worn by Leit the Crusader during his reign as leader of the Thronheim Clan.  It was with this armor he slayed the foul creatures that inhabited the area that would become Thronheim City.  It is said to prevent sword from ever touching skin. (Effects: +40 AC against melee attacks, -10 AC against missiles)"
msgstr ""
"这件铠甲是十字军莱特在担任索隆海姆氏族首领期间所穿。他穿着这件铠甲，斩杀了栖息在后来成为索隆海姆城的那片土地上的邪恶生物。据说它能使刀剑永远无法触及肌肤。（效果：对近战攻击防御 +40，对远程攻击防御 -10）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:162
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "It is said that this helm is made from the skull of Ilthic, the most powerful witch of the Ursanian Empire. Rumor is, Emperor Ralfor himself severed her head.  After removing the unnecessary parts, he had the new helmet enchanted against magical attacks. (Effects: +20 all resistances, +20 AC vs magic attacks)"
msgid ""
"It is said that this helm is made from the skull of Ilthic, the most powerful witch of the Ursanian Empire. Rumor is, Emperor Ralfor himself severed her head.  After removing the unnecessary parts, he had the new helmet enchanted against magical attacks. (Effects: +20 to all resistances, +20 AC against magic)"
msgstr ""
"据说这顶头盔是用乌尔萨尼亚帝国最强大的女巫伊尔西克的头骨制成的。传闻拉尔福皇帝亲自斩下了她的头颅。他剔除了多余的部分后，让人为这顶新头盔附上了抵御魔法攻击的魔力。（效果：所有抗性 +20，对魔法攻击防御 +20）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:162
msgid "Witchbane"
msgstr "女巫克星"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:163
msgid "Brongnoker"
msgstr "布龙诺克"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:163
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Pitted and dented, this helm does not look like much.  Looks can be deceiving however.  Brongnoker was made before the founding of the Ursanian Empire, with long lost forging techniques.  This helm is probably the finest protection for the head in the world. (Effects: +10 all stats, +10 Armor skill)"
msgid ""
"Pitted and dented, this helm does not look like much.  Looks can be deceiving however.  Brongnoker was made before the founding of the Ursanian Empire, with long lost forging techniques.  This helm is probably the finest protection for the head in the world. (Effects: +10 to all stats, +10 to the armor skills)"
msgstr ""
"这顶头盔坑坑洼洼，满是凹痕，看上去不怎么样。然而外表可能具有欺骗性。布龙诺克诞生于乌尔萨尼亚帝国建立之前，采用早已失传的锻造技术。这顶头盔很可能是世上最出色的头部防具。（效果：所有属性 +10，护甲技能 +10）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:164
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "These boots were made for walking.  However, because of the special enchantments put upon them to protect the traveller's feet, they have been used more often by the fortunate soldier who happened upon them. (Effects: +10 Speed; of Everlasting, of Regeneration, of Amelieoration; +10 to all resistances)"
msgid ""
"These boots were made for walking.  However, because of the special enchantments put upon them to protect the traveller's feet, they have been used more often by the fortunate soldier who happened upon them. (Effects: +10 Speed, +10 to all resistances, regenerates HP, immune to weakness and drunkenness, never breaks)"
msgstr ""
"这双靴子天生为行走而造。不过，由于上面附有保护旅行者双脚的特殊魔法，偶然得到它们的幸运士兵比旅行者更常使用它们。（效果：速度 +10；永恒、再生、改良；所有抗性 +10）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:165
msgid "Laet'ax"
msgstr "拉埃特斧"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:165
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This pair of soft leather gloves was found outside Verhoffin's tower in 300 AC.  They are soft, and somewhat slippery.  No matter the size of the wearer's hand, they seem to always fit. (Effects: -10 Accuracy, +10 Luck; +5 Disarm Trap)"
msgid ""
"This pair of soft leather gloves was found outside Verhoffin's tower in 300 AC.  They are soft, and somewhat slippery.  No matter the size of the wearer's hand, they seem to always fit. (Effects: -20 Accuracy, +40 Luck, +10 Disarm Traps)"
msgstr ""
"这双柔软的皮手套于公元300年在维尔霍芬之塔外被发现。它们柔软而略显滑腻。无论佩戴者的手大小如何，它们似乎总是合手。（效果：准确 -10，运气 +10；拆除陷阱 +5）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:166
msgid "Arrowfoe"
msgstr "箭之敌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:166
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This sheild was carried by the mighty warrior Hrothgar Krohnssen.  He claimed to be the son of Krohn himself, and possesed mighty strength.  When a witch told him he was to be killed by an arrow, he had this shield constructed to protect him from that fate.  Unfortunately, the arrow that killed him struck him from behind. (Effects: +30 AC vs Missle weapons)"
msgid ""
"This shield was carried by the mighty warrior Hrothgar Krohnssen.  He claimed to be the son of Krohn himself, and possessed mighty strength.  When a witch told him he was to be killed by an arrow, he had this shield constructed to protect him from that fate.  Unfortunately, the arrow that killed him struck him from behind. (Effects: +30 Endurance, +30 AC against missiles)"
msgstr ""
"这面盾牌曾由强大的战士赫罗斯加·克罗恩森所持。他自称是克罗恩本人之子，拥有强大的力量。当一名女巫告诉他将死于一支箭下时，他便命人打造了这面盾牌，以保护自己免遭此命运。不幸的是，杀死他的那支箭是从背后射中他的。（效果：对远程武器防御 +30）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:167
msgid "Hubris"
msgstr "傲慢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:167
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This belt was looted from the Chasm of the Dead, and is allegedly the belt that was worn by Emperor Hubris himself when he began to forge the Ursanian Empire.  Some scholars believe that this belt helped him defeat the invaders and create an empire. (Effects: +30 Might; +20 AC; of Endurance, of Protection, of Arms Mastery; Increased chance to hit target.)"
msgid ""
"This belt was looted from the Chasm of the Dead, and is allegedly the belt that was worn by Emperor Hubris himself when he began to forge the Ursanian Empire.  Some scholars believe that this belt helped him defeat the invaders and create an empire. (Effects: +30 Might, +10 Endurance, +20 AC, +5 Armsmaster)"
msgstr ""
"这条腰带是从亡者深渊中掠来的，据称是许布里斯皇帝本人开始缔造乌尔萨尼亚帝国时所系的腰带。一些学者认为，这条腰带帮助他击败了入侵者并建立了帝国。（效果：力量 +30；防御 +20；耐力、保护、武器大师；命中目标的几率提高。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:168
msgid "Weregild"
msgstr "赎命金"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:168
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Weregild was created by Snorri the Dwarf as a wedding gift for his soon to be son-in-law.  Unfortunately, another of his daughter's suitor's became jealous and stole the ring on the wedding night.  In his rage, he cursed the ring, and gave it back to the newlyweds.  Seeing through his deception, Snorri slew the suitor and cast the ring away. (Effects: +1000 gold per week.  Reputed -40 party Endurance.)"
msgid ""
"Weregild was created by Snorri the Dwarf as a wedding gift for his soon to be son-in-law.  Unfortunately, another of his daughter's suitors became jealous and stole the ring on the wedding night.  In his rage, he cursed the ring, and gave it back to the newlyweds.  Seeing through his deception, Snorri slew the suitor and cast the ring away. (Effects: +30 Luck, 1,000 gold each week, -40 Endurance for the whole party)"
msgstr ""
"赎命金是矮人斯诺里为他即将成为女婿的人所造的结婚礼物。不幸的是，他女儿的另一位求婚者心生嫉妒，在新婚之夜偷走了戒指。他在盛怒之下诅咒了戒指，并把它还给了新婚夫妇。斯诺里识破了他的欺骗，杀死了那名求婚者，并将戒指抛弃。（效果：每周 +1000金币。据传队伍耐力 -40。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:169
msgid "Soulband"
msgstr "灵魂指环"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:169
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Soulband wasn't so much created as it was evolved from something else.  It started it's life as a trinket worn by a small child who became possessed by a Revenant.  Since that time it has passed from owner to owner, taking a little piece of them with when it passed to it's new owner. (Effects: +50 SP; +5 Light, +3 Meditiation; of Speed)"
msgid ""
"Soulband wasn't so much created as it was evolved from something else.  It started its life as a trinket worn by a small child who became possessed by a Revenant.  Since that time it has passed from owner to owner, taking a little piece of them with it when it passed to its new owner. (Effects: +10 Speed, +50 SP, +5 Light Magic, +3 Meditation, faster recovery)"
msgstr ""
"灵魂指环与其说是被制造出来的，不如说是由别的东西演变而来。它最初是一个小孩佩戴的小饰品，那孩子后来被亡魂附身。从那以后，它在一位位主人之间传递，每次易主都带走了前任主人的一小部分。（效果：魔法值 +50；光明魔法 +5，冥想 +3；速度）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid "Hatchet"
msgstr "手斧"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid ""
"More a tool than a weapon, when necessary, one could make do with this axe"
msgstr "与其说是武器，不如说是工具，必要时也可以拿这把斧头凑合着用。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:170
msgid "Sturkabygel"
msgstr "斯图卡比格尔"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:170
msgid ""
"Sturkabygel was looted from the dwarven town of Minespring when it was razed by Ichvan I in 75 AC.  It was taken by one of his soldiers who went on to become one of his most prominent generals.  After his death, it was kept in the family as an heirloom.  It was taken from them by the Thjoradric Raiders during a raid of Heronport. (Effects: +10 Might, +5 Endurance, +100 HP)"
msgstr ""
"斯图卡比格尔是公元75年伊奇万一世夷平矮人城镇矿泉镇时被掠走的。它被他的一名士兵拿走，此人后来成为他最杰出的将军之一。将军死后，它作为传家宝留在家族中。后来，在一次袭击鹭港的行动中，它被乔拉德劫掠者从他们手中夺走。（效果：力量 +10，耐力 +5，生命值 +100）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:171
msgid "Lubricious"
msgstr "滑溜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:171
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Some claim that Lubricious was actually made from these ingredients: the slip of a snake, the sly of a fox, and the nimbleness of a hare.  It was given to Helga Gunnarsdotir by a salacious suitor.  Not caring a whit for him, she promptly sold the ring. (Effects: +20 AC; +5 Dodging; Reputed -3% to Damage.)"
msgid ""
"Some claim that Lubricious was actually made from these ingredients: the slip of a snake, the sly of a fox, and the nimbleness of a hare.  It was given to Helga Gunnarsdotir by a salacious suitor.  Not caring a whit for him, she promptly sold the ring. (Effects: +20 AC, +5 Dodging, 3% less physical damage taken)"
msgstr ""
"有人声称滑溜实际上是用这些原料制成的：蛇的滑腻、狐狸的狡黠和野兔的敏捷。一位轻浮的求婚者把它送给了赫尔加·贡纳尔多蒂尔。她丝毫不在乎那人，当即就把戒指卖掉了。（效果：防御 +20；闪躲术 +5；据传伤害 -3%。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:172
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This amulet was a gift from The Green Man.  Very few are blessed with a visit to The Green Man, and fewer still have a gift bestowed upon them for it. (Effects: +20 SP; +3 Meditation, +5 Light, +5 Spirit; of Regeneration)"
msgid ""
"This amulet was a gift from The Green Man.  Very few are blessed with a visit to The Green Man, and fewer still have a gift bestowed upon them for it. (Effects: +20 SP, +3 Meditation, +5 Light Magic, +5 Spirit Magic, regenerates HP)"
msgstr ""
"这枚护身符是绿人赠予的礼物。很少有人能有幸得到绿人的造访，得到他赠礼的人就更少了。（效果：魔法值 +20；冥想 +3，光明魔法 +5，灵魂魔法 +5；再生）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:173
msgid "Mountbatten"
msgstr "芒巴顿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:173
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This amulet was carried by the four mystical sages, Dirk, Stig, Nasty, and Barry.  These four men had, for a time carried a message of peace and happiness to the Chedian, before they were chased out forever.  In their hurry to go, they left this behind. (Effects: +5 Dark, +3 Perception; of Amelioration)"
msgid ""
"This amulet was carried by the four mystical sages, Dirk, Stig, Nasty, and Barry.  These four men had, for a time carried a message of peace and happiness to the Chedian, before they were chased out forever.  In their hurry to go, they left this behind. (Effects: +30 Personality, +5 Dark Magic, +3 Perception, immune to weakness and drunkenness)"
msgstr ""
"这枚护身符曾由四位神秘贤者德克、斯蒂格、纳斯蒂和巴里携带。这四人曾一度向切迪安人传递和平与幸福的讯息，随后被永远驱逐。匆忙离开时，他们把这枚护身符落下了。（效果：暗黑魔法 +5，洞察术 +3；改良）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:174
msgid "Pendant of the Spheres"
msgstr "天球坠饰"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:174
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This pendant was taken by Nazrim the Assassin from Verhoffin's Tower around 10 BC.  Nazrim had been charged with slaying Verhoffin for his insolence towards the Ursanian Empire.  Many think that it is that event, the attempted assassination of Verhoffin that caused the Great Cataclysm. (Effects: +5 All magic skills, +3 Learning, +3 Meditation)"
msgid ""
"This pendant was taken by Nazrim the Assassin from Verhoffin's Tower around 10 BC.  Nazrim had been charged with slaying Verhoffin for his insolence towards the Ursanian Empire.  Many think that it is that event, the attempted assassination of Verhoffin that caused the Great Cataclysm. (Effects: +3 to all magic skills, +3 Learning, +3 Meditation)"
msgstr ""
"这枚坠饰是刺客纳兹里姆大约在公元前10年从维尔霍芬之塔中取走的。纳兹里姆受命因维尔霍芬对乌尔萨尼亚帝国的傲慢无礼而将其刺杀。许多人认为，正是这次对维尔霍芬的刺杀行动引发了大灾变。（效果：所有魔法技能 +5，学习术 +3，冥想 +3）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:175
msgid "Fizbin of Misfortune"
msgstr "厄运菲兹宾"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:175
msgid "Holy Relic"
msgstr "圣物"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:175
msgid ""
"The Fizbin always seems to appear in the worst of times.  Just when someone thinks things can't get any worse, they acquire the Fizbin.  It's fame precedes it, and most owners have a hard time getting rid of it. (Effects: While carried, for the whole party: +15 Might, +15 Accuracy, -20 Luck, +10 to all resistances, random encounters 15% more likely)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:176
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Beggers are often seen in the major towns of Chedian, and many complain to have any sort of adverse condition.  Oftentimes, a healer would curse the begger with the affliction he claimed to have.  One begger, Haelik the Diseased, created this amulet to protect himself from such healers. (Effects: -3 Learning; Immune to all conditions.  Drains Experience Points.)"
msgid ""
"Beggars are often seen in the major towns of Chedian, and many complain to have any sort of adverse condition.  Oftentimes, a healer would curse the beggar with the affliction he claimed to have.  One beggar, Haelik the Diseased, created this amulet to protect himself from such healers. (Effects: -3 Learning, immune to all conditions, 15% less experience)"
msgstr ""
"乞丐在切迪安的大城镇中随处可见，许多人抱怨自己身患各种病痛。治疗师往往会拿乞丐声称的病症反过来诅咒他。一位名叫病患海利克的乞丐制作了这枚护身符，以保护自己免受此类治疗师的侵害。（效果：学习术 -3；免疫所有状态。消耗经验值。）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:176
msgid "Screever"
msgstr "涂鸦客"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:177
msgid "Fre's Heart"
msgstr "弗蕾之心"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:177
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This heart-shaped amulet was created in honor of Fre, the goddess of Vita.  It was last carried by D'vorna Life-Toucher, the Healer who travelled through Chedian healing it's inhabitants for exorborant prices.  He was found stealing from the house of a rich merchant in Thjorgard, and was put to death.  This ring was taken from him as payment for the things he stole. (Effects: +50 to HP, -10 SP; of regeneration)"
msgid ""
"This heart-shaped amulet was created in honor of Fre, the goddess of Vita.  It was last carried by D'vorna Life-Toucher, the Healer who travelled through Chedian healing its inhabitants for exorbitant prices.  He was found stealing from the house of a rich merchant in Thjorgard, and was put to death.  This amulet was taken from him as payment for the things he stole. (Effects: +30 Endurance, +100 HP, -20 SP, regenerates HP)"
msgstr ""
"这枚心形护身符是为纪念生命女神弗蕾而制作的。最后一位携带者是生命之触德沃娜，这位治疗师游历切迪安，以高昂的价格为当地居民治病。他在乔加德一位富商家中行窃时被抓获，并被处死。这枚戒指作为他所偷之物的赔偿被没收。（效果：生命值 +50，魔法值 -10；再生）"

