#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:178
msgid ""
"During the Rise of the Old Ursanian Empire, there were great Gladiatorial Games held in honor of the current Emperor's feast-day. The greatest Gladiator of those games was honored with a set of armor and weapon. When he wore this prize all would know his greatness and would probably decide not to mess with him as well. Usable by Mercenary and Gladiator only. (Effects: +2 Body Building, +4 Armsmaster (+40 to hit with complete set))"
