#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC361.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC409.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:15
msgid "Farewell"
msgstr "告辞"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC111.rude:1
msgid ""
"Go find someone who is brave and noble, such as one of the Jarls.  I'm certain they would be happy to perform the Sword-Brother Ceremony for you."
msgstr "去找个勇敢高尚的人吧，比如某位雅尔。我相信他们会很乐意为你们举行剑兄弟仪式。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC111.rude:1
msgid "How does one become a Sword-Brother."
msgstr "怎样才能成为剑兄弟？"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC111.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am Sword-Brother to Hrolf Anfarssen.  It looks as though he's going to get into a fight.  If you don't mind, I need to be watching his back."
msgstr "我是赫罗尔夫·安法尔森的剑兄弟。看样子他要打起来了。如果你不介意，我得去守住他的后背。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9-2.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC111.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:4
