# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:235
msgid ""
"Invoice for services\n"
"\n"
"Brevan Ketilssen agrees to pay the sum of 400 gold for transportation of 10 lbs. of Elemental Thjorad."
msgstr ""
"服务账单\n"
"\n"
"布雷万·凯蒂尔森同意支付400金币，用于运输10磅元素乔拉德。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:236
msgid ""
"Letter to Eloise\n"
"\n"
"My dearest Eloise,\n"
"I know your father forbids our relationship, but I find myself thinking of you day after day.  Please, I implore you.  Meet me at our field in Thjorgard.  I have made plans to spirit away to Sturmford to be married.\n"
"My undying love,\n"
"Hrolf"
msgstr ""
"致埃洛伊丝的信\n"
"\n"
"我最亲爱的埃洛伊丝：\n"
"我知道你父亲不许我们来往，可我日复一日地思念着你。求求你，到乔加德我们的那片田野来见我。我已经计划好，我们悄悄私奔到斯图姆福德去成亲。\n"
"永远爱你的\n"
"赫罗尔夫"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:237
msgid ""
"Invoice\n"
"\n"
"30 lbs Wheat                   10 gold\n"
"100 Gallons Ale               60 gold\n"
"35 Gallons Mead              20 gold\n"
"10 lbs Assorted Nuts        10 gold\n"
"Total                              100 gold\n"
"Money due upon receipt."
msgstr ""
"账单\n"
"\n"
"小麦30磅                 10金币\n"
"麦芽酒100加仑            60金币\n"
"蜂蜜酒35加仑             20金币\n"
"什锦坚果10磅             10金币\n"
"合计                    100金币\n"
"收货时付款。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:238
msgid ""
"Letter to Gunnar\n"
"\n"
"Gunnar,\n"
"Because of your recent activities, and your constant refusal to join with the other Thjoradric Smiths, I'm afraid we are going to have to restrict your supply of Elemental Thjorad.  In addition, you will be paying an additional 20 gold per ounce.  You've been a good friend to me over the years, but this is business, and I've got the other Thjoradric Smiths to think of.  I'm sorry to do this, but you've forced my hand.\n"
"Atli"
msgstr ""
"致贡纳尔的信\n"
"\n"
"贡纳尔：\n"
"鉴于你最近的所作所为，以及你一再拒绝加入其他乔拉德铁匠的行列，恐怕我们不得不限制对你的元素乔拉德供应。此外，你每盎司还要额外多付20金币。这些年来你一直是我的好朋友，但生意就是生意，我还得为其他乔拉德铁匠着想。很抱歉这么做，但这是你逼我的。\n"
"阿特利"

